  <para style="h">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca mbere ca Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Sa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca mbere ca</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samweli</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ukuvuka kwa Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Habaye umugabo umwe yaba i Ramatayimu-Zofimu mu karere k’imisozi y’Abefurayimu, yitwa Elukana mwene Yerohamu, Yerohamu mwene Elihu, Elihu mwene Tohu, Tohu mwene Zufi, wo mu muryango wa Efurayimu. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Yari afise abagore babiri, umwe yitwa Hana uwundi yitwa Penina. Penina yari afise abana, ariko Hana ntiyagira n’umwe.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Uko umwaka utashe uwo mugabo yama ava mu gisagara c’iwabo akaduga gusenga no gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ikimazi i Shilo, aho abahungu ba Eli babiri, Hofuni na Finehasi, bakorera nk’abaherezi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Igihe cose hageze ko Elukana atanga ikimazi, yama aha imigabane y’inyama umugore wiwe Penina n’abahungu biwe n’abakobwa biwe bose. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Ariko Hana we yamuha umugabane ungana incuro zibiri uwa Penina kuko yamukunda, naho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaramwimye uruvyaro. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Mukeba wiwe yama amucurira ngo amubabaze, kubera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaramwimye uruvyaro. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Ivyo vyabandanije gutyo uko imyaka yakurikirana. Igihe cose Hana yaja mu nzu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mukeba wiwe yama amucurira gushika aho arira ntagire n’ico afungura. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Elukana umugabo wiwe akamubwira ati: “Hana, ni kuki urira? Ni kuki udafungura? Ni kuki ubabaye? Mbega sindakurutira abahungu icumi wovyaye?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Igihe kimwe bahejeje kurya no kunywa i Shilo, Hana arahaguruka. Ico gihe Eli umuherezi yari yicaye ku ntebe ku muryango w’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hana asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’umubabaro mwinshi wo mu mutima ararira cane. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Asezerana isezerano, avuga ati: “Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, niwaraba amagorwa yanje umusavyikazi wawe ukanyibuka, ntiwibagire umusavyikazi wawe ukampa umwana w’umuhungu, nanje nzomushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu misi y’ukubaho kwiwe kwose, kandi nta rwembe ruzokwigera rumugera ku mutwe.”<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Uko yashishikara gusenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni ko Eli yamuraba ku munwa. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana yasengera ku mutima, kandi agakubita iminwa naho ijwi ryiwe ritumvikana. Eli we yibaza ko yaborewe, <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />aca aramubwira ati: “Uzogeza ryari kwama uborewe? Heba uwo muvinyu wawe.”<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Hana aramwishura ati: “Oyaye nyakwubahwa, si ko biri, ndi umugore afise ingorane nyinshi. Sinanyoye umuvinyu canke ikindi kiboreza na kimwe, nariko ndasuka umubabaro wo mu mutima wanje imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Ntiwibaze ko umusavyikazi wawe ndi umugore w’umunyangesombi, nariko ndasenga kubera umubabaro n’agahinda biri muri jewe.”<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Eli aramwishura ati: “Niwigire amahoro, Imana y’Abisirayeli ikwishure iguhe ico wayisavye.”<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Na we aravuga ati: “Icompa umusavyikazi wawe nkagirirwa ubuntu imbere yawe.” Nuko aca ava aho hantu, arafungura, maze mu maso hiwe ntihasubira kwiraburanirwa.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Mu gitondo ca kare baravyuka basenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> hanyuma basubira iwabo i Rama. Elukana aryamana n’umugore wiwe Hana, maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwibuka. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Nuko Hana asama inda avyara umuhungu amwita Samweli, avuga ati: “Kuko namusavye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hana ashikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Hageze ko Elukana adugana n’umuryango wiwe wose gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikimazi c’umwaka no gushitsa isezerano ryiwe, <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Hana ntiyashoboye kujana na bo. Nuko abwira umugabo wiwe ati: “Uwu muhungu niyacuka, nzomujana ndamushikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we azoba imbere y’Uhoraho ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Elukana umugabo wiwe aramubwira ati: “Uze ukore ikizokubera ciza. Guma ngaha gushika umucukije; kimwe gusa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashitse ijambo ryiwe.” Nuko uwo mugore aguma i muhira arera umuhungu wiwe gushika aho yamucukirije.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Amaze kumucutsa, ajana wa muhungu, naho yari akiri muto, n’ishuri imaze imyaka itatu, n’ifu ingana n’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 16.</char></note> n’umukuza w’umuvinyu, amujana mu nzu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Bamaze gutanga ya shuri kw’ikimazi, bazanira Eli wa muhungu, <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />nyina wiwe aramubwira ati: “Nyakwubahwa, urakaramba! Ndi wa mugore nahagarara i ruhande yawe nsenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Nariko ndasaba uwu mwana, none <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yampaye ico namusavye. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />None ubu ndamushikaniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ubuzima bwiwe bwose azoba ari uw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Maze bapfukamira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> baramusenga.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Isengesho rya Hana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Maze Hana asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">“Umutima wanje unezererewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we wangize uwukomeye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Ubu ndafise ico nishura abansi banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">kuko nezerejwe n’ugutabara kwawe.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Nta wera nk’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">nta wundi yoboneka i ruhande yawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">nta Gitandara gihwanye n’Imana yacu.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Nimureke kuvugana ubwibone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">iminwa yanyu ntivuge ivyo kwishira hejuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari Imana izi vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">kandi ni yo ipima ibikorwa vyose ku munzane.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Imiheto y’abagwanyi iravunaguritse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">ariko abahoze ari abanyantegenke bambitswe inkomezi.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Abari bafise ivyuzuye, babaye abacangero, bakorera ivyo barya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">kandi abahora bashonje, bashize inzara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Uwahora yitwa ingumba, avyaye abana indwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">ariko uwari afise abahungu benshi arakabiranye.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we atuma umuntu apfa kandi ni we atuma abaho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">ni we amanura bamwe i kuzimu, abandi akabakurayo.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we atuma bamwe bakena, kandi ni we atuma abandi batunga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">ni we acisha bugufi bamwe, agashira hejuru abandi.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Akura umugorwa mu mukungugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">ashira hejuru umukene, amukuye mu mwavu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">akamwicarikana n’abakomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">akamuha intebe y’icubahiro.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:8" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Kuko imfatiro z’isi ari iz’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">Kandi kuri zo ni ho yashinze isi.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Ni we azozigama ibirenge vy’abamukorera mu bwizigirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">ariko abanyakibi bazokamanganira mu mwijima.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">Inkomezi z’umuntu si zo zituma anesha;<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />abagwanya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bazocika ubunywenywe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Iyisumbavyose izobaturagarirako iri mw’ijuru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azocira urubanza impera z’isi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Azoha inkomezi umwami yimitse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">kandi yongere inkomezi uwo yimikishije amavuta.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Hanyuma Elukana ataha iwe i Rama, ariko wa muhungu akorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari musi y’uburongozi bwa Eli umuherezi.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ububi bw’abahungu ba Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Abahungu ba Eli bari abantu babi; ntibubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Hariho ingeso abaherezi bari basigaye bafise y’uko igihe cose umuntu yaza gushikana ikimazi, umukozi w’umuherezi yaca azana icaruzo c’amenyo atatu mu minwe, akaza igihe inyama z’ico kimazi zikiriko ziratogotera ku ziko, <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />agaca yinjiza ca caruzo mu nkono canke mu kintu cose batetsemwo izo nyama, umuherezi agaca atwara izo ico caruzo caruye. Ivyo ni vyo bagirira Abisirayeli bose baza i Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Vyaranashika ko umukozi w’umuherezi aza ibinure vy’ikimazi bitaraturirwa n’umuriro ku gicaniro, akabwira uwariko arashikana ikimazi ati: “Zana inyama zo kwokereza umuherezi; ntashaka izimaze gutekwa, ashaka izikiri mbisi.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Iyo uwo muntu yishuye ati: “Reka mbanze nturire ibinure vyazo, hanyuma uheze utware izo ugomba zose,” uwo mukozi yaca yishura ati: “Oya zizane ubu nyene; utazizanye naho, ndaziha ku nguvu.”<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Ico caha c’abo bahungu cari kinini cane mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko bakengera ibimazi vyiwe.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Ariko Samweli we naho yari akiri agahungu gatoya yakomeje gukorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Yambara efodi yera nk’iyo abaherezi bambara. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Uko umwaka utashe, nyina yama amushonera agakanzu gatoya akakamushira aduganye n’umugabo wiwe gutanga ikimazi c’umwaka. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Imbere y’uko bataha, Eli yama aca ahezagira Elukana n’umugore wiwe, akavuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aguhe abana kuri uwu mugore kugira ngo baje mu gishingo c’uwu yasengeye agaca amuha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Bagaca bataha. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agirira ubuntu Hana; avyara abahungu batatu n’abakobwa babiri. Wa mwana Samweli na we abandanya akurira imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Ico gihe Eli yari ashaje cane, ariko yarumva ivyo abahungu biwe bakorera Abisirayeli, ko baryamana n’abagore bakorera ibikorwa mu rwinjiriro rw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Nuko akama ababwira ngo: “Ni kuki mukora ibintu nk’ivyo? Numva abantu bose babavuga ko mwigenza nabi. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Nimusigeho, bana banje! Inkuru numva ivugwa mu bantu b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> si nziza. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Iyo umuntu acumuye ku wundi, Imana ishobora kubuzuriza; ariko umuntu acumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni nde yomuvugira?” Ariko abahungu biwe ntibumvira impanuro za se, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yagabiye ko bategerezwa gupfa.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Samweli we abandanya gukura mu mubiri no kugira igikundiro k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no ku bantu.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imburi ku nzu ya Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Nuko haza umuntu w’Imana ashikira Eli aramubwira ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Siniyeretse abo mu nzu ya so igihe bari bakiri muri Egiputa baganzwa na Farawo?’ ” <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Natoranije so mu yindi miryango yose y’Abisirayeli ngo ambere umuherezi, ngo aje ku gicaniro canje, acane ibimota neza, kandi yambare efodi imbere y’inyonga zanje. Kandi nahaye abo mu nzu ya so ibimazi vyose vyoswa n’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />None ni kuki mukengera ikimazi canje n’ishikanwa ryanje? Ni kuki wubaha abahungu bawe ukabandutisha mu kwirira inyama z’indobanurwa z’ibimazi vyose ihanga ryanje ry’Abisirayeli batanze?<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />“Nguku rero uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: ‘Nari narasezeranye ko inzu ya so ari yo izokorera imbere yanje ibihe vyose.’ Ubu rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati: ‘Ntibikabe!’ Abanyubaha ni bo nzokwubaha, ariko abankengera nanje nzobakengera.” <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Ehe igihe kiraje aho nzokwaka inkomezi wewe n’inzu ya so nkabaka ubuherezi, kugira ngo ntihabe hakibaho umuntu aramba mu ruvyaro rwawe, <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />kandi uzoba mu mubabaro uri mu nzu yanje. Naho Abisirayeli bazogirirwa neza, mu ruvyaro rwawe ntihazokwigera hongera kuboneka umuntu aramba agashika mu zabukuru. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Uwo nzosigaza adakuwe ku gicaniro canje azoba ari uwo kuguteza umubabaro no kukwihebuza, kandi abo mu ruvyaro rwawe bose bazopfa bakiri bato. Ariko abandi bose bazopfa bakiri mu myaka y’ubuto.<verse eid="1SA 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />“ ‘Ibizoba kuri Hofuni na Finehasi, abahungu bawe babiri, bizoba ikimenyetso c’ivyo, bazopfira umusi umwe. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Nzokwitorera uwuzombera umuherezi w’umwizigirwa, azokora ibiri ku mutima wanje no mu vyiyumviro vyanje. Kandi nzokomeza inzu y’ubuherezi bwiwe, baze bame bakorera imbere y’abami nasize amavuta ibihe vyose. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Ico gihe umuntu wese wo mu muryango wawe azosigara azoza amwunamire kugira ngo amuhe igiceri kimwe c’ifeza n’akavunguka k’umukate kandi amwinginge ati: “Ntabara umpe ico nkora mu bikorwa vy’ubuherezi kugira ngo ndonke ico kurya.” ’ ”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Uhoraho ahamagara Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Uwo muhungu Samweli akorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> musi y’uburongozi bwa Eli. Kandi, muri iyo misi, kwumva ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> vyari imbonekarimwe; no kwerekwa kwari guke cane.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Ico gihe, Eli ntiyari akibona neza, amaso yiwe yari atanguye guhuma. Ijoro rimwe, Eli aja kuryama aho yari asanzwe aryama. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Itara ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiryari bwazime, kandi na Samweli yari aryamye mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, impande y’Isandugu y’Imana. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahamagara Samweli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:4">Samweli aritaba ati: “Sabwe!” <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Aca yiruka iyo Eli ari aravuga ati: “Ndi hano; wampamagaye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Ariko Eli aravuga ati: “Sinaguhamagaye, subira kuryama.” Nuko aragenda araryama.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> asubira guhamagara ati: “Samweli!” Maze Samweli aravyuka aja iyo Eli ari aravuga ati: “Ndi hano; wampamagaye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Eli aramwishura ati: “Mwana wanje, sinaguhamagaye; subira kuryama.”<verse eid="1SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Samweli ntiyari bwamenye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuko ntiyari bwumve ijambo rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahamagara Samweli ubugira gatatu, maze Samweli aravyuka aja iyo Eli ari aravuga ati: “Ndi hano; wampamagaye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Maze Eli aca amenya ko ari <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ariko arahamagara uwo muhungu. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Nuko Eli aca abwira Samweli ati: “Genda uryame, niyasubira kuguhamagara, uce uvuge uti: ‘Vuga, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko umusavyi wawe ndaguteze amatwi.’ ” Nuko Samweli aragenda araryama mu kibanza ciwe.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> araza asubira guhamagara nk’uko yari yamye abigira ubwa mbere ati: “Samweli! Samweli!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Maze Samweli aravuga ati: “Vuga, kuko umusavyi wawe ndaguteze amatwi.”<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Samweli ati: “Ehe, ngira nkore ikintu mu Bisirayeli kizotuma uwuzocumva wese agira iminzerere mu matwi. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Ngiye gushitsa kuri Eli ivyo namuburiye vyose ko bizomubako n’umuryango wiwe, uhereye ku ca mbere gushika ku ca nyuma. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Naramuburiye ko ngiye gucira urubanza rw’ibihe vyose umuryango wiwe kubera icaha co gucokora <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> asanzwe azi neza ko abahungu biwe bakora, ariko ntababuze. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Kubera ivyo nararahiye abo mu nzu ya Eli nti: ‘Icaha c’inzu ya Eli ntikizokwigera gitangirwa impongano yaba iy’ikimazi canke iy’ishikanwa.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samweli asubira kuryama gushika mu gitondo aca yugurura imyango y’inzu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko aratinya kubwira Eli ivyo yabwiwe. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Ariko Eli aramuhamagara amubwira ati: “Samweli mwana wanje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Samweli arishura ati: “Sabwe!”<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eli aramubaza ati: “Mbega bwabundi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakubwiye iki? Ntubimpishe. Imana ibiguhanire, kandi birushirije, niwaramuka umpishije na kimwe mu vyo yakubariye.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Nuko Samweli amubwira vyose, ata na kimwe amuhishije. Nuko Eli aravuga ati: “Ni <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; nakore ibibereye mu nyonga ziwe.”<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abana na Samweli mu gukura kwiwe, kandi ijambo ryose Samweli yavuga Imana yararyubahiriza ikarishitsa. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Kandi Abisirayeli bose uhereye i Dani ugushika i Berisheba bamenya ko Samweli ari uwuvugishwa n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> w’ukuri. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abandanya kwiyerekanira aho i Shilo, akiyereka Samweli biciye mw’ijambo ryiwe.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Kandi amajambo ya Samweli yagenda ashikirizwa Abisirayeli bose.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1SA 4:1">Abafilisitiya bafata Isandugu y’Isezerano</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Muri ico gihe, Abisirayeli baja kugwana n’Abafilisitiya. Abisirayeli bakoranira ahitwa Ebenezeri, Abafilisitiya na bo bakoranira ahitwa Afeki. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Abafilisitiya bakoranya ingabo zabo zose kugira ngo baje gutera Abisirayeli. Intambara irakomera cane, maze Abisirayeli baneshwa n’Abafilisitiya, babicamwo abantu ibihumbi bine ku rugamba. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Abasoda bagarutse aho bari bacumbitse, abakuru b’Abisirayeli barabaza bati: “Ni kuki <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatumye tuneshwa uwu musi imbere y’Abafilisitiya? Nimuze tuzane Isandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> iri i Shilo, kugira ngo ajane natwe adukize ukuboko kw’abansi bacu.”<verse eid="1SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Nuko abantu batuma intumwa i Shilo, baragenda bazana ya Sandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, avyagiye ku ntebe y’ubwami hagati y’Abakerubi. Abahungu ba Eli babiri, Hofuni na Finehasi, bari kumwe n’Isandugu y’Isezerano y’Imana.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Ya Sandugu y’Isezerano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ishitse aho bacumbitse, Abisirayeli bose barahaguruka biha akamo gakomeye kugeza aho isi inyiganyiga. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Abafilisitiya bumvise ako kamo, barabazanya bati: “Mbega ako kamo ko mu Baheburayo kavuye ku ki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Bamaze kumenya ko ari kubera Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ishitse aho bacumbitse, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Abafilisitiya bagira ubwoba. Baravuga bati: “Imana yaje hagati muri bo. Turashize! Nta kintu nk’ico cari bwigere kibaho! <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Turashize! Ni nde yodukiza ukuboko kw’izo mana zikomeye z’Abisirayeli? Izo ni zo zateje ivyago bikomeye cane Abanyegiputa igihe Abisirayeli bari mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Yemwe Bafilisitiya nimushikame! Mube abagabo, atari aho na ho muca muba abagurano b’Abaheburayo, nk’uko na bo bahora ari abagurano bacu. Nimube abagabo, mugwane!”<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Nuko Abafilisitiya baragwana, hanyuma Abisirayeli baraneshwa, umuntu wese ahungira mw’ihema ryiwe. Abishwe bari benshi cane; uwo musi mu Bisirayeli hapfa abasoda ibihumbi mirongo itatu. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Isandugu y’Imana irafatwa, na Hofuni na Finehasi bene Eli barapfa.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Kuri uwo musi nyene, umuntu umwe wo mu muryango wa Benyamini ariruka ava ku rugamba aja i Shilo, yitabaguriyeko impuzu ziwe, yisutse n’umukungugu mu mutwe. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Ashitse asanga Eli yicaye ku ntebe yiwe i ruhande y’inzira, agerageza kwumva amakuru y’intambara, kuko yari ahagaritswe umutima n’Isandugu y’Imana. Uwo muntu yinjiye mu gisagara ababwira ivyabaye, abo muri ico gisagara bose baca bakoma induru.<verse eid="1SA 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli yumvise iyo nduru aca abaza ati: “Mbega iyo nduru ni iy’iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:14">Wa muntu yihutira kuja aho Eli yari ari. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Eli yari amaze imyaka mirongo icenda n’umunani, amaso yiwe yarahumye atakibona. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Nuko abwira Eli ati: “Mvuye ubu nyene ku rugamba; mpunze mvayo uwu musi nyene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Eli aramubaza ati: “None vyagenze gute ga mwana wanje?”<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Wa muntu yazanye inkuru arishura ati: “Abisirayeli bahunze imbere y’Abafilisitiya, kandi hapfuye abasoda benshi cane. Mbere n’abahungu bawe bompi, Hofuni na Finehasi bapfuye, n’Isandugu y’Imana bayitwaye.”<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Amaze kuvuga ivy’Isandugu y’Imana, Eli yikubita hasi atanguza umugongo avuye kuri ya ntebe yiwe aho yari ari i ruhande y’irembo. Izosi ryiwe riravunika aca arapfa, kuko yari ashaje kandi avyibushe cane. Yari amaze imyaka mirongo ine ari umucamanza w’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Umukazana wiwe, muka Finehasi, yari afise inda igeze kuvuka, yumvise iyo nkuru ko Isandugu y’Imana yafashwe kandi ko sebukwe n’umugabo wiwe bose bapfuye, afatwa n’ibise aca aravyara, ariko agira umubabaro urenze urugero. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Ari ku mpfiro, abakirizi baravuga bati: “Ntiwihebure; uvyaye umuhungu.” Ariko ntiyagira ico yishura canke ngo anavyiteho.<verse eid="1SA 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Yita uwo muhungu Ikabodi, risigura ngo: “Icubahiro kivuye kuri Isirayeli,” kuko bafashe Isandugu y’Imana kandi sebukwe n’umugabo wiwe bakaba bapfuye. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Aravuga ati: “Icubahiro cavuye kuri Isirayeli ko Isandugu y’Imana yafashwe.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Isandugu y’Imana ija i Ashidodi n’i Ekuroni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Abafilisitiya bamaze gufata Isandugu y’Imana, bayikura i Ebenezeri bayijana i Ashidodi. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Batwara iyo Sandugu mu ngoro y’ikigirwamana Dagoni baca bayishira hambavu ya Dagoni. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Ariko, umusi ukurikira mu gitondo, abantu b’i Ashidodi, baravye babona ico kigirwamana Dagoni caguye cubamye hasi imbere ya ya Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>! Baca bafata ico kigirwamana Dagoni bagisubiza mu kibanza caco. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Bukeye mu gitondo bavyutse, babona ico kigirwamana Dagoni cubamye imbere y’Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, umutwe waco n’ibikonjo vyaco vyacitse birambaraye mu rwinjiriro; umutumba waco usigaye uri wonyene. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Ni co gituma gushika n’ubu ata muherezi wa Dagoni canke uwundi muntu yinjira mu ngoro ya Dagoni iri i Ashidodi ashobora gukandagira mu rwinjiriro.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kwari guhanamiye abantu b’i Ashidodi n’imihana ihakikije; kuko kwabateza ivyago n’ibihute. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Abantu b’i Ashidodi babonye ibibaye, baravuga bati: “Isandugu y’Imana y’Abisirayeli ntishobora kuguma hano muri twebwe, kuko ukuboko kwayo kugomba kuturandura twebwe n’imana yacu Dagoni.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Nuko batumako abatware bose b’Abafilisitiya barababaza bati: “Iyi Sandugu y’Imana y’Abisirayeli tuyigire dute?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Na bo barabishura bati: “Iyo Sandugu y’Imana y’Abisirayeli nimuyimurire i Gati.” Nuko barayimura.<verse eid="1SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Ariko bamaze kuyimura, ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kubangamira abantu b’ico gisagara, bituma bacika ivutu rwose. Abantu b’ico gisagara, uhereye ku bakiri bato ukageza ku bashaje, bose baterwa n’ibihute. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Nuko baca barungika iyo Sandugu y’Imana i Ekuroni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:10">Ya sandugu igiseruka i Ekuroni, abantu baho bose bakoma induru bati: “Bazanye ya Sandugu y’Imana y’Abisirayeli muri twebwe kugira ngo itwicane n’abacu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Nuko baca batumako abatware bose b’Abafilisitiya baravuga bati: “Nimwirukane iyo Sandugu y’Imana y’Abisirayeli; muyisubize aho yahora, bitari uko na ho izotumara twebwe n’abantu bacu.” Abantu bo muri ico gisagara bari bacitse ivutu rwose, kubera ubwoba, batinya gupfa; kuko ukuboko kw’Imana kwari kubangamiye ico gisagara. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Abatapfuye bafashwe n’ibihute birabasesereza cane, gushika aho amaborogo y’abo muri ico gisagara aduga agashika mw’ijuru.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Isandugu igaruka muri Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Iyo Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> imaze mu gihugu c’Abafilisitiya amezi indwi, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Abafilisitiya bahamagara abaherezi n’abapfumu barababaza bati: “Iyi Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> tuyigire dute? Tubwire uko twoyirungika igasubira iyo yaje iva.”<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Barabishura bati: “Nimwasubiza iyo Sandugu y’Imana y’Abisirayeli, ntimuyirungike igaragara, ariko muyirungikane n’ikimazi co kwisaba, kugira ngo mukire ivyo vyago. Nimwakira, muzoca mumenya ko ivyo vyago mwabiterwa n’ukuboko kwayo.”<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Abafilisitiya barababaza bati: “Ni ikihe kimazi co kwisaba twoyishikanira?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Barabishura bati: “Ni ibihute bitanu bicuzwe mu nzahabu n’imbeba zitanu zicuzwe mu nzahabu, nk’uko igitigiri c’abatware b’Abafilisitiya kingana, kuko ivyo vyago vyabateye mwebwe n’abatware banyu bose. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Mucure ibishushanyo vy’ivyo bihute n’izo mbeba biriko biratikiza igihugu, hanyuma mubirungikire iyo Mana y’Abisirayeli muyihe icubahiro. Kumbure yobagirira ikigongwe ikabakurako ukuboko kwayo kubahanamiye mwebwe n’imana zanyu n’igihugu canyu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Ni kuki mukomantaza imitima yanyu nka kumwe Abanyegiputa na Farawo bagira? Mbega iyo Mana imaze kubahana bikomeye, ntibahavuye barekura Abisirayeli bakigira?<verse eid="1SA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Nuko rero, nimurondere umukogote mushasha, n’inka zibiri zonsa kandi zitigeze zambikwa ingogo, muheze muziremeke uwo mukogote, ariko inyana zazo muzisubize mu ruhongore. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Mwakire ya Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> muyishire kuri wa mukogote, mushire i ruhande yayo akandi gasandugu karimwo vya bihute na za mbeba bicuzwe mu nzahabu mwateguye kumushikanira nk’ikimazi co kwisaba, hanyuma muce mureka izo nka zigende, <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />ariko muzikurikize amaso. Nizaduga zija mu gihugu ca Isirayeli, zikagenda zerekeye i Beti-Shemeshi, azoba ari <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaduteje ibi vyago. Ariko nibitaba uko, tuzoca tumenya ko atari ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kwadukubise, ko ivyadushikiye ari ivyizanye gutyo gusa.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Nuko bakora uko nyene. Bafata za nka baziboherako wa mukogote baca basubiza inyana zazo mu ruhongore. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Bashira ya Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku mukogote hamwe na ka gasandugu karimwo za mbeba zicuzwe mu nzahabu na vya bimenyetso vy’ibihute. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Nuko za nka zigenda zerekeye i Beti-Shemeshi, zitumbereye inzira kandi zigenda zabira inzira yose; ntizahindukira i buryo canke i bubamfu. Abatware b’Abafilisitiya barazikurikira gushika zigeze ku rubibe rw’i Beti-Shemeshi.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Abantu b’i Beti-Shemeshi bariko barimbura ingano mu kiyaya, bunamutse babona ya Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, banezerezwa cane no kuyibona. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Uwo mukogote uraza ushika mu murima wa Yosuwa w’i Beti-Shemeshi, uhagararaho i ruhande y’igitandara kinini. Abantu baca basatagura ibiti bigize wa mukogote baca batanga za nka kw’ikimazi co guturirwa bagishikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Abalewi bururutsa ya Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na ka gasandugu karimwo vya bintu bicuzwe mu nzahabu, babirambika kuri ca gitandara kinini. Kuri uwo musi abantu b’i Beti-Shemeshi bashikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amashikanwa aturiwe n’ibimazi. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Ba bakuru batanu b’Abafilisitiya babonye ivyo vyose baca basubira i Ekuroni kuri uwo musi nyene.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Vya bihute bicuzwe mu nzahabu Abafilisitiya barungitse nk’ikimazi co kwisaba bashikaniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> vyatanzwe n’abakuru b’ibisagara vya Ashidodi, Gaza, Ashikeloni, Gati na Ekuroni. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Igitigiri ca za mbeba zicuzwe mu nzahabu cangana n’igitigiri c’ibisagara vy’i Bufilisitiya vyatwarwa n’abatware batanu, ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro n’imihana ihakikije. Ico gitandara kinini, bateretseko iyo Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni icabona c’ivyabaye gushika n’uno musi aho kiri mu murima wa Yosuwa w’i Beti-Shemeshi.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahana abantu bamwe b’i Beti-Shemeshi, yica mirongo indwi muri bo kuko baravye mw’Isandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Abantu barabagandarira bababajwe n’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabahanye bikomeye. <verse eid="1SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Abantu b’i Beti-Shemeshi barabazanya bati: “Ni nde yoshobora guhagarara imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, iyo Mana itunganye? Mbega iyi sandugu twoyijana kwa nde ngo tuyikure hano?”<verse eid="1SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Baca barungika intumwa ku bantu b’i Kiriyati-Yeyarimu, bavuga bati: “Abafilisitiya bagarukanye ya Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Nimumanuke muyidugane iwanyu.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Nuko abantu b’i Kiriyati-Yeyarimu badugana iyo Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bayijana mu rugo kwa Abinadabu rwari ku gasozi, baca barobanura Eliyezeri umuhungu wiwe kugira ngo yiteho iyo Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samweli atsindira Abafilisitiya i Misipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Iyo Sandugu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> imara igihe kirekire kingana n’imyaka mirongo ibiri yose, ikiri i Kiriyati-Yeyarimu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 7:2">Muri ico gihe, Abisirayeli bose batakambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bababaye kuko bumva umenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarabahevye. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Maze Samweli abwira Abisirayeli bose ati: “Nimwaba mugarutse k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’imitima yanyu yose, nimwitandukanye n’ibigirwamana vy’amahanga hamwe n’ibishushanyo vya Ashitaroti, mwiyegurire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi mumukorere wenyene, na we azobakiza abakure mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Nuko Abisirayeli bitandukanya n’ibigirwamana Bayali na Ashitaroti, bakorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wenyene.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Hanyuma Samweli aravuga ati: “Nkoraniriza Abisirayeli bose i Misipa nanje ndabasengera k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Bamaze gukoranira i Misipa, bavoma amazi bayasuka imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Kuri uwo musi barisonzesha maze baratura bati: “Twaracumuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Aho i Misipa ni ho Samweli yakorera nk’umucamanza w’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Abafilisitiya bamenye ko Abisirayeli bakoraniye i Misipa, abatware b’Abafilisitiya baca baduga kubatera. Abisirayeli na bo bavyumvise, baca baterwa n’ubwoba bwinshi kubera abo Bafilisitiya. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Babwira Samweli bati: “Ntuhagarike gutakambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu ku bwacu, kugira ngo adutabare adukure mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Maze Samweli afata umwagazi w’intama uconka awushikanira wose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kw’ikimazi co guturirwa n’umuriro. Atakambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kubw’Abisirayeli, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura.<verse eid="1SA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Samweli agitanga ca kimazi giturirwa n’umuriro, Abafilisitiya barabegereza ngo babahwikire. Ariko kuri uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aturagarira hejuru y’Abafilisitiya nk’umuturagaro ukomeye, bacika ivutu kubera ubwoba, bituma Abisirayeli babatsinda. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Abisirayeli baca bavuduka i Misipa bakurikira Abafilisitiya, bagenda barabicira mu nzira gushika musi y’igisagara ca Beti-Kari.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Maze Samweli afata ibuye arishinga hagati y’i Misipa n’i Sheni, aryita Ebenezeri, bisigura ngo: “Gushika n’ubu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aracadutabara.”<verse eid="1SA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Nuko Abafilisitiya baratsindwa ntibasubira kwongera gutera Abisirayeli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 7:13">Igihe cose Samweli yari akiriho, ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kwagumye guhanamiye Abafilisitiya. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Abisirayeli bigarurira ibisagara vyose vyari hagati y’i Ekuroni n’i Gati, ivyo Abafilisitiya bari barabanyaze, kandi Abisirayeli bigarurira n’intara yari ibegereye bayinyaze Abafilisitiya. Haba impore hagati y’Abisirayeli n’Abamori.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Nuko Samweli aguma ari umucamanza w’Abisirayeli imisi yose yabayeho. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Ku mwaka yama afata urugendo akava i Beteli aja i Gilugali gushika i Misipa, acira Abisirayeli imanza muri ivyo bice vyose. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Ariko yama ataha i Rama, ahari urugo rwiwe, kandi n’aho nyene yarahacira imanza z’Abisirayeli. Maze yubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igicaniro aho nyene.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli basaba umwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Samweli ariko arasaza, aha abahungu biwe uburongozi, baba abacamanza b’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Imfura yiwe yitwa Yoweli, uwa kabiri akitwa Abiya, kandi bakorera i Berisheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Ariko abahungu ba Samweli ntibakurikije akarorero ka se, kuko bakikamye bakarondera inyungu mbi, batangura kurya ibiturire no guca imanza zitabereye.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Nuko abakuru bose bo mu Bisirayeli baja hamwe baja aho Samweli yari ari i Rama. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />Baramubwira bati: “Raba urashaje, kandi abana bawe ntibakurikiza akarorero kawe; nuko rero turonderere umwami wo kuturongora, nk’uko bimeze mu yandi mahanga.”<verse eid="1SA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Ariko bamaze kuvuga bati: “Duhe umwami wo kuturongora,” ivyo bibabaza Samweli; aca asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo amusobanuze. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramubwira ati: “Niwemere ivyo vyose abantu bariko barakubwira; kuko si wewe banse, ni jewe banse ko nshishikara kuba umwami wabo. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Uko bari bameze kuva igihe nabakura muri Egiputa gushika n’uwu musi, ni ko bakimeze, bama bantera ibitugu bakaja gukorera izindi mana, kandi nawe ni vyo bakugiriye. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Ubu rero bumvirize; ariko ubagabishe, ubamenyeshe neza ivyo umwami azobaganza bazotegerezwa kumukorera.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Nuko Samweli abwira abo bantu bariko baramusaba umwami amajambo yose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamubwiye. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Ababwira ati: “Ibi ni vyo umwami azobaganza azobasaba ko mumukorera: azofata abahungu banyu abakoreshe ku mikogote no ku mafarasi yiwe, kandi bazohora bama bagenda bariruka imbere y’imikogote yiwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Bamwe azobagira abo kuganza abasoda igihumbi, abandi abo kuganza abasoda mirongo itanu gutyo gutyo, abandi babe abo kumurimira amatongo yiwe no kwimbura ivyimburwa vyiwe, kandi abandi bazoba abo gucura ibigwanisho vy’intambara n’ibikoresho vy’imikogote yiwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Abakobwa banyu azobatwara babe abo guhingura ibimota neza, abatetsi n’abotsa imikate. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Azotwara imirima, imizabibu n’imyelayo vyanyu vyizavyiza, abihe abamukorera. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Azotwara ikigiracumi c’ingano zanyu n’imizabibu yanyu abihe abishikira biwe n’abamukorera. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Abakozi banyu b’abahungu n’abakobwa n’ivyiza vyo mu nka n’indogoba vyanyu azobitwara abikoreshe ivyiwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Azotwara ikigiracumi c’amasho yanyu, kandi namwe ubwanyu muzoba abagurano biwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Uwo musi niwashika, muzotaka musaba icobakurako uwo mwami muriko murasaba, ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntazobishura.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Ariko abantu banka kwumviriza Samweli. Baravuga bati: “Oya, dushaka umwami wo kutuganza. <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />Natwe tuzoca tuba nk’ayandi mahanga, dufise umwami wo kuturongora kandi akatuja imbere tugiye kugwana mu ntambara.”<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Maze Samweli yumvise ivyo abantu bavuze vyose, abibwira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amwishura ati: “Kora ivyo bagusavye ubahe umwami.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 8:22">Nuko Samweli abwira Abisirayeli ati: “Umuntu wese nasubire mu gisagara ciwe.”<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Samweli arobanuza amavuta Sawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Hariho Umuntu wo mu muryango wa Benyamini, yari atunze, yitwa Kishi wa Abiyeli, Abiyeli wa Zerori, Zerori wa Bekorati, Bekorati wa Afiya, Afiya wa Benyamini. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Uwo Kishi yari afise umuhungu yitwa Sawuli, yari umuhungu mwiza w’akaranga kurusha Abisirayeli bose, kandi no mu burebure yarabasumba bose.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Umusi umwe indogoba za Kishi se wa Sawuli zirazimira, maze Kishi abwira umuhungu wiwe Sawuli ati: “Jana n’umukozi umwe muje kurondera izo ndogoba.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Nuko baca mu ntara y’imisozi ya Efurayimu no mu karere kegereye Shalisha, ariko ntibazibona. Barabandanya baca mu ntara y’i Shayalimu, ariko izo ndogoba ntizariyo. Nuko baca mu ntara ya Benyamini, ariko ntibazitora.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Bashitse mu karere k’i Zufi, Sawuli abwira wa mukozi bari kumwe ati: “Nuze dusubire inyuma, kuko data yohava areka kwiyumvira indogoba ziwe agatangura guhagarikira umutima twebwe.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Ariko wa mukozi amwishura ati: “Raba muri iki gisagara hari umuntu w’Imana; arubashwe rwose, kandi ico avuze cose kiba kuno. Reka tujeyo ubu nyene. Kumbure yotubwira inzira dukwiye kujana.”<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Sawuli abwira uwo mukozi wiwe ati: “Mbega nitwajayo uwo muntu tumugemurira iki? Ehe indya zaheze mu mifuko yacu! Nta co dufise tugemurira uwo muntu w’Imana. Nta co dusigaranye?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Uwo mukozi arongera amubwira ati: “Raba ndafise ica kane ca shekeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 3.</char></note> y’ifeza. Ndaja kugiha uwo muntu w’Imana kugira ngo aturangire inzira dukwiye kujana.” <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />(Kera muri Isirayeli, iyo umuntu agiye gusiguza Imana, yavuga ati: “Ingo, tuje kuraba uwerekwa,” kuko uwitwa uwuvugishwa n’Imana uno musi, ico gihe yitwa uwerekwa.)<verse eid="1SA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sawuli abwira umukozi wiwe ati: “Ni vyiza, ingo tugende.” Nuko bagenda batumbereye ico gisagara wa muntu w’Imana yabamwo.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Bakiduga umusozi baja muri ico gisagara, bahura n’abakobwa bavuyeyo bamanutse kuvoma amazi, barababaza bati: “Mbega uwerekwa yoba ari ho ari?”<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Barabishura bati: “Ni ho ari. Ari aho imbere yanyu. Nimwihute; ashitse mu gisagara ubu nyene, kuko abantu bateguye gutanga ikimazi hejuru ku musozi. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Nimunyaruke mumushikire ataraja ahabera amazimano. Abantu ntibaja gufungura adashitse, kuko ategerezwa kubanza guhezagira ikimazi; mu nyuma yaho abatumiwe baca bafungura. Nimuduge; muca mumubona mu mwanya.”<verse eid="1SA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Baraduga baja mu gisagara, maze bacinjira, babona Samweli, aza atumbereye aho bari ariko araduga muri ico kibanza kiri hejuru ku musozi.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Ariko umusi umwe imbere y’uko Sawuli aza, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yiyeretse Samweli amubwira ati: <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Ejo nk’aya masaha nzokurungikira umuntu avuye mu muryango wa Benyamini. Uze umurobanuze amavuta abe umurongozi w’abantu banje b’Abisirayeli; ni we azorokora abantu banje abakure mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya. Nahindukirije inyonga zanje ku bantu banje, kandi ugutakamba kwabo kwanshikiriye.”<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Samweli akibona Sawuli, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramubwira ati: “Uwo ni wa muntu nakubwira; ni we azorongora abantu banje.”<verse eid="1SA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Sawuli yegera Samweli mw’irembo ry’igisagara aramubaza ati: “Woshobora kundangira inzu y’umwe yerekwa?”<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samweli aramwishura ati: “Ni jewe nyene. Nuduge unyitangire imbere hejuru ku musozi, kuko uno musi uza gusangira nanje, maze mu gitondo nzoca nkubwira ivyo ukeneye kumenya vyose hanyuma nkurekure ugende. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Ku vyerekeye za ndogoba mwabura na zo, hakaba haheze imisi itatu, ntuhagarikwe umutima na zo; bazitoye. Kandi, hari uwundi Abisirayeli bahanze amaso atari wewe n’umuryango wawe?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sawuli aramwishura ati: “Ariko, jewe ndi uwo mu muryango wa Benyamini, umuryango mutoya inyuma y’iyindi muri Isirayeli, mbere n’inzu nkomokamwo ni yo ya nyuma mu nzu zigize umuryango wose wa Benyamini! Ni iki gitumye umbwira iryo jambo?”<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Nuko Samweli ajana Sawuli n’umukozi wiwe mu nzu abicarika imbere y’abari batumiwe bari nka mirongo itatu. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samweli abwira umutetsi ati: “Nzanira ya nyama naguha, imwe nakubwira ngo uyishire ku ruhande.”<verse eid="1SA 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Nuko wa mutetsi azana ya nyama ayishira imbere ya Sawuli. Samweli aravuga ati: “Ibi ni ivyo twaguteguriye. Fungura, kuko ni wewe vyari vyabikiwe, mbere n’imbere y’uko ntumira aba bandi.” Maze Sawuli asangira na Samweli kuri uwo musi.<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Bamaze kumanuka bava kuri wa musozi baja mu gisagara, Samweli adugana Sawuli mu kibanza co hejuru ku nzu yiwe amutegurira aho arara. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Mu mutwenzi baravyuka, maze Samweli ahamagara Sawuli yari akiri muri ca kibanza co hejuru ku nzu, amubwira ati: “Niwitegure, ngomba ndakurungike usubire iwanyu.” Sawuli amaze kwitegura, asohokana na Samweli hanze. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Bariko baramanuka, bageze aho igisagara kigarukira, Samweli abwira Sawuli ati: “Bwira uwo mukozi wawe atwitangire imbere.” Wa mukozi aca akora uko abariwe aragenda. Samweli yongerako ati: “Wewe guma aha akanya gato, kugira ngo nkubwire ubutumwa buvuye ku Mana.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Nuko Samweli yugurura agacupa karimwo amavuta ya elayo, ayasuka ku mutwe wa Sawuli aca aramusoma, avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akurobanuje amavuta ngo ube umurongozi w’ubwoko bwiwe. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Uno musi nyene, tumaze gutandukana, uraza guhura n’abagabo babiri hafi y’imva ya Rasheli, iri i Zeluza ku rubibe rw’intara ya Benyamini. Na bo baraja kukubwira bati: ‘Za ndogoba mwari mwagiye kurondera zaratowe. Ubu so ntagihagaritswe umutima na zo, ahubwo ahagaritswe umutima na mwebwe. Aguma abaza ico yokora kugira ngo atore umuhungu wiwe.’<verse eid="1SA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Hanyuma uvuye ngaho ukabandanya uzoshikira igiti kinini kiri i Tabori. Uzohura n’abagabo batatu bazoba bariko baraduga i Beteli gusenga Imana. Umwe azoba afise imyagazi y’impene itatu, uwundi imikate itatu, uwundi umukuza ukozwe mu rusato urimwo umuvinyu. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Bazokuramutsa baguhe imikate ibiri, kandi uze uyakire.<verse eid="1SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Hanyuma uzoshika i Gibeya hitwa ah’Imana, ahari ikambi y’Abafilisitiya. Uri hafi gushika mu gisagara, uzohura n’umugwi w’abavugishwa bavuye ku musozi ahari ikibanza co gusengeramwo, bazoba bafise inanga, udushako tw’ingoma, imyironge n’amakembe, kandi abari imbere yabo bazoba bagenda barabivuza, bongera baravugishwa. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoca akuzako mu bushobozi, nawe uvugishwe hamwe na bo; kandi uzoca uhinduka ube uwundi muntu. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Ivyo bimenyetso vyose nivyashika, uzoce ukora ikintu cose amaboko yawe ashobora gukora, kuko Imana izoba iri kumwe nawe.<verse eid="1SA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Kandi uze unyitangire imbere kuja i Gilugali. Nanje nzogusangayo nje gutanga ibimazi biturirwa n’umuriro hamwe n’ivy’ishimwe, ariko uze urindire imisi indwi gushika aho nzozira kugira ngo ndakubwire ibindi ukwiye gukora.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawuli aba umwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Sawuli ahindukiye ngo atandukane na Samweli, Imana ihindura umutima wiwe, kandi ivyo bimenyetso vyose bishika kuri uwo musi nyene. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Sawuli na wa mukozi wiwe bashitse i Gibeya, bahura n’umugwi w’abavugishwa; Mpwemu w’Imana amuzako mu nkomezi, na we atangura kuvugishwa hamwe na bo. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Abari basanzwe bamuzi bamubonye avugishwa hamwe na ba bavugishwa, barabazanya bati: “Mbega ibi ni ibiki vyabaye kuri mwene Kishi? Mbega burya Sawuli na we yari asanzwe ari mu mugwi w’abavugishwa n’Imana?”<verse eid="1SA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Umwe mu bari ngaho aca arabishura avuga ati: “Mbega abandi bo, ba se ni ba nde?” Ni ho havuye uwu mugani ngo: “Mbega burya na Sawuli nyene arimwo mu bavugishwa?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sawuli ahejeje kuvugishwa, aca aduga kuri wa musozi wo gusengerako.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Maze sewabo wa Sawuli abaza Sawuli na wa mukozi wiwe ati: “Mwahora he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Sawuli amwishura ati: “Twari twagiye kurondera za ndogoba, ariko tubonye ko tudashoboye kuzibona, twaciye tuja kwa Samweli kumusiguza.”<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Sewabo aca aramubwira ati: “Mbwira rero ivyo Samweli yakubariye.”<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sawuli yishura sewabo ati: “Yaratumenyesheje ko indogoba zatowe.” Ariko ntiyabwira sewabo ivyo Samweli yavuze bijanye no kuba umwami.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Nuko Samweli ahamagaza Abisirayeli bose ngo bakoranire imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Misipa <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />hanyuma arababwira ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: ‘Abisirayeli nabazanye ndabakuye mu gihugu ca Egiputa, ndabakura mu bubasha bw’Abanyegiputa n’ubw’abandi bami babacinyiza.’ <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Ariko mwateye ibitugu Imana yanyu, kandi ari yo ibakiza ivyago n’ibiza vyose. Hanyuma mwavuze muti: ‘Oya, duhe umwami wo kutuganza.’ Nuko rero nimuze muhagarare imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uko imiryango n’amazu ya ba sogokuruza banyu biri.”<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Maze Samweli amaze kwegeranya imiryango yose y’Abisirayeli, umuryango wa Benyamini aba ari wo werekanwa n’ubupfindo. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Nuko azana umuryango wa Benyamini uko amazu ya ba sekuruza ari, inzu ya Matirite aba ari yo yerekanwa. Mu nyuma Sawuli mwene Kishi aba ari we yerekanwa. Ariko bamurondeye, ntiyaboneka. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Nuko basiguza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bati: “Mbega uwo muntu yoba araza hano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Egome, yinyegeje mu mizigo.”<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Nuko baragenda bamukurayo, kandi ahagaze mu bantu akabaruta mu burebure bose. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samweli abwira abantu ati: “Murabona umuntu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatoranije? Nta n’umwe ameze nka we mu bantu bose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Nuko abantu bose biha akamo bati: “Umwami arakaramba!”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Samweli asigurira abantu ivyo umwami asabwa gukora n’ivyo akorerwa, aca avyandika mu gitabu agishira imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Nuko Samweli arungika abantu, umwe wese ataha iwe.<verse eid="1SA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Na Sawuli ataha iwe i Gibeya, aherekejwe n’abahizi Imana yakoze ku mitima. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Ariko abantu b’imburakimazi baravuga bati: “Uwu mugabo yodukiza gute?” Baramukengera ntibamuzanira amashikanwa. Ariko Sawuli arinumira.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Sawuli atabara abo mu gisagara c’i Yabeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo, umwami w’Abamoni Nahashi araduga atera igisagara ca Isirayeli citwa Yabeshi Gileyadi. Abantu b’i Yabeshi baramwinginga bati: “Turagusavye tugiriranire amasezerano, utureke tube abasavyi bawe.”<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Ariko Nahashi umwami w’Abamoni abishura ati: “Ndemera ko tugiriranira amasezerano, ariko mbanza kunogora umuntu wese wo muri mwebwe ijisho ry’i buryo kugira ngo Abisirayeli bose babe ibimaramare.”<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Abakuru b’i Yabeshi baramubwira bati: “Turindire imisi indwi tubanze turungike intumwa mu Bisirayeli bose; nihataboneka n’umwe wo kudutabara, tuzoca tukwishikanira udukoze ico ugomba.”<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Nuko intumwa zija i Gibeya, igisagara Sawuli yabamwo, zibwira abantu ayo majambo y’umwami w’Abamoni; maze bose baca baraturikisha bararira n’ijwi rirenga. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Sawuli na we yariko arava mu mirima, ashoreye inka ziwe zirima. Arabaza ati: “Habaye iki? Ni kubera iki abantu bose bariko bararira?” Baca bamusubiriramwo ivyo abo bantu b’i Yabeshi bababwiye.<verse eid="1SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Sawuli yumvise ayo majambo, Mpwemu w’Imana amuzako mu nkomezi nyinshi, aca arashavura cane. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Afata inka zirima zibiri, azicagaguramwo ibihimba, abirungikana intumwa mu gihugu cose ca Isirayeli, n’ubutumwa buvuga ngo: “Uku ni ko inka z’umuntu wese atazokurikira Sawuli na Samweli mu ntambara zizohimbagurwa.” Nuko ubwoba buvuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bufata abantu, baca bakoranira hamwe nk’umuntu umwe. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Igihe Sawuli yabegeraniriza hamwe i Bezeki, abagabo b’Abisirayeli bari ibihumbi amajana atatu, abagabo b’i Buyuda na bo bari ibihumbi mirongo itatu.<verse eid="1SA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Babwira za ntumwa zari zaje ziva i Yabeshi bati: “Mubwire abantu b’i Yabeshi Gileyadi muti: ‘Ejo mu gihe c’amashoka, muzotabarwa.’ ” Za ntumwa ziragenda zimenyesha abantu b’i Yabeshi iyo nkuru, na bo baranezerwa cane. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Baca babwira Abamoni bati: “Ejo tuzokwishikana mu maboko yanyu, namwe muze mudukoze ico mugomba cose.”<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Bukeye Sawuli agabura abantu biwe mu mice itatu; maze hakiri mw’ijoro, ariko bugiye guca, bashika giturumbuka aho Abamoni bacumbitse babamarisha inkota igitondo cose kugeza mu gihe c’amashoka. Abacitse kw’icumu barasanzara, kugeza aho ata bantu babiri bashoboye guhunga bari kumwe.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawuli yemezwa ko ari umwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Maze abantu baca babwira Samweli bati: “Ni ba nde bavuze ngo: ‘Aho Sawuli arakwiye kutuganza?’ Batuzanire tubice!”<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Ariko Sawuli aravuga ati: “Nta muntu n’umwe yicwa kuri uno musi, kuko ari umusi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatabaye Abisirayeli.”<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Nuko Samweli abwira abantu ati: “Nimuze tuje i Gilugali dusubire gukomeza ivy’ubwami.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Nuko abantu bose baja i Gilugali, bemeza Sawuli ko ari umwami imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Baca batangira aho nyene imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi vy’ishimwe, maze Sawuli n’Abisirayeli bose bagira umusi mukuru ukomeye.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Samweli asezera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Samweli abwira Abisirayeli ati: “Narumvise ivyo mwambariye vyose none namaze kubaha umwami wo kubaganza. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Ubu rero murafise umwami wo kubarongora. Jewe ndashaje, mfise imvi, mbere n’abahungu banje bari ngaha muri mwebwe. Nabaye umurongozi wanyu kuva nkiri muto gushika uno musi. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />None mpagaze hano. Nimunyagirize imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’uwo yimikishije amavuta. Ni nde nanyaze inka yiwe? Ni nde nanyaze indogoba yiwe? Ni nde nagunze? Ni nde nacinyije? Ni nde yampaye igiturire kugira ngo kimpume amaso? Nihaba hari ikintu na kimwe kinyagira muri ivyo vyose, ndagitunganya.”<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Baramwishura bati: “Ntiwatugunze, ntiwaducinyije kandi nta n’umwe wanyaze ikintu na kimwe.”<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Samweli arabishura ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we cabona imbere yanyu hamwe n’uwo yimikishije amavuta ko ata na kimwe munyagiriza, amaboko yanje yoba yariyandurishije.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Baramwishura bati: “Ni vyo, Uhoraho ni we cabona.”<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Nuko Samweli abwira abantu ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yatoranije Mose na Aroni kandi ni we yakuye ba sogokuruza banyu muri Egiputa. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Nuko rero, nimuze hano imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabibutse ivyiza vyose yabakoreye mwebwe na ba sogokuruza banyu.<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Yakobo n’abiwe bamaze gushika muri Egiputa, ba sogokuruza banyu batakambiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo abatabare, maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atuma Mose na Aroni, baba ari bo babakura muri Egiputa babashira muri iki gihugu.<verse eid="1SA 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Ariko baciye bibagira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo; bituma abarekurira mu maboko ya Sisera, umukuru w’ingabo z’i Hazori, no mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya n’umwami w’i Mowabu barabagwanya. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Maze batakambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bavuga bati: ‘Twaracumuye; twataye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> dukorera Bayali na Ashitaroti. Ariko niwadutabara ukadukiza amaboko y’abansi bacu ubu, natwe tuzogukorera.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arungika Yerubayili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Irindi zina rya Gidiyoni.</char></note>, Baraki, Yefuta na Samweli, abakura mu maboko y’abansi banyu impande zose, muca muba mu mahoro.<verse eid="1SA 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Ariko mubonye Nahashi umwami w’Abamoni aje kubatera, muraza mumbwira muti: ‘Tugomba umwami wo kutuganza,’ kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu yari asanzwe ari umwami wanyu. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />None rero ng’uwu umwami mwahisemwo, uwo mwasavye; raba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahaye umwami wo kubaganza. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Nimwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mukamukorera, mukamwumvira ntimugararize amabwirizwa yiwe; mwebwe n’umwami abatwara nimwakurikira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu bizoba ari vyiza. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Ariko nimutubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mukagarariza amabwirizwa yiwe, ukuboko kwiwe kuzobahanamira, nk’uko kwahanamiye ba sogokuruza banyu.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Ubu rero, nimuhagarare mushikamye, murabe ikintu gihambaye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agira akorere imbere y’amaso yanyu! <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Mbega ubu si mw’iyimbura ry’ingano? Murazi ko ata mvura isanzwe igwa. Ngira nambaze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na we ararekura imituragaro n’imvura. Hanyuma muratahura ikibi mwakoze imbere y’inyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu kwubahuka kumusaba umwami.”<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Nuko Samweli yambaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Kuri uwo musi nyene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arungika imituragaro n’imvura, bituma abantu bose bafatwa n’ubwoba bwinshi, batinya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na Samweli.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Abantu bose babwira Samweli bati: “Dusabire k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe twebwe abasavyi bawe kugira ngo ntidupfe, kuko kuri vya vyaha vyacu vyose, twongeyeko ikindi kibi co gusaba umwami.”<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samweli arabishura ati: “Ntimutinye. Egome mwarakoze ivyo bibi vyose, ariko ntimusubire gutera ibitugu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko mumukorere n’imitima yanyu yose. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Ntimusubire guhindukirira ibigirwamana bitagira ikimazi. Ntibishobora kubakorera iciza na kimwe, canke ngo bibakize, kuko bitagira ikimazi. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Ku bw’icubahiro c’izina ryiwe rihambaye, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntazota abantu biwe, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> vyamuhimbaye kubagira ihanga yiharije. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Kandi jewe, ntibikambeko ko nocumura k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu kureka kubasengera. Nzoshishikara kubigisha ivyiza n’ibigororotse. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Ariko muze mwubahe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mumukorere mu bwizigirwa n’imitima yanyu yose, mwibuke ibihambaye vyose yabakoreye. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Ariko nimwashishikara gukora ibibi, mwebwe n’umwami wanyu muzohona mwese.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Samweli abwira Sawuli ko yacumuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sawuli yari amaze imyaka mirongo itatu igihe yaba umwami, hanyuma aganza Abisirayeli imyaka mirongo ine n’ibiri.<verse eid="1SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sawuli atoranya abasoda ibihumbi bitatu mu Bisirayeli; abasigaye abarungika iwabo. Muri abo yahisemwo, atoramwo ibihumbi bibiri bajana na we i Mikimashi, mu ntara y’imisozi ya Beteli, abandi igihumbi bajana n’umuhungu wiwe Yonatani i Gibeya mu ntara ya Benyamini. Abasigaye bose abarungika iwabo.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Umusi umwe, Yonatani atera ikirindiro c’Abafilisitiya cari i Geba aragitsinda, maze Abafilisitiya bose baravyumva. Nuko Sawuli asaba ko bavuza inzamba mu gihugu cose, avuga ati: “Nimubimenyeshe Abaheburayo bose!” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Nuko Abisirayeli bose bumva iyo nkuru ngo: “Sawuli yateye ikirindiro c’Abafilisitiya aragisambura, none Abafilisitiya banka Abisirayeli urwanko rukomeye.” Nuko abasoda bose barahamagarana basanga Sawuli i Gilugali.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Abafilisitiya na bo bakoranira hamwe ngo batere Abisirayeli, bafise imikogote ibihumbi bitatu n’abagendera ku mikogote ibihumbi bitandatu, n’abasoda bangana n’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga. Nuko baraduga bacumbika i Mikimashi, mu buseruko bwa Beti-Aveni. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Abisirayeli babonye ko bibakomeranye, kuko bari bazigirijwe, baja kwinyegeza mu masenga, mu myobo, mu bitandara, no mu binogo vyimbiwe kubika amazi. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Bamwe mu Baheburayo barahunga bajabuka Yorodani baja mu ntara ya Gadi na Gileyadi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Sawuli aguma i Gilugali, kandi abasoda bose bari kumwe na we bariko barajugumira kubera ubwoba. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Nuko Sawuli arindira Samweli imisi indwi, nk’uko Samweli yari yamubwiye; ariko Samweli ntiyaza i Gilugali; maze abasoda batangura guta Sawuli barashwiragira. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Sawuli aravuga ati: “Nimunzanire ca kimazi co gutongozwa umuriro na vya bimazi vy’ishimwe.” Nuko Sawuli atanga ca kimazi co gutongozwa umuriro. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Agiheza kugitanga, Samweli aca arashika, maze Sawuli asohoka kumusanganira.<verse eid="1SA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Samweli aramubaza ati: “Ibi wakoze ni ibiki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Sawuli arishura ati: “Nabonye abantu bariko barashwiragira, nawe mbona ntiwubahirije isango, kandi Abafilisitiya bariko bariyegeraniriza i Mikimashi, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />nca ndibaza nti: ‘Abafilisitiya bahava bamanuka kuntera i Gilugali, basange ntarambaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo antabare.’ Nuko nca numva notanga jewe nyene ikimazi co gutongozwa umuriro.”<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Samweli aramubwira ati: “Wakoze ivy’ubupfu. Kuko ntiwumviye ibwirizwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yaguhaye; iyo uryumvira yotumye ingoma yawe ihoraho ibihe vyose mu Bisirayeli. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Ariko noneho ubwami bwawe ntibuzoramba; <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamaze kwironkera umuntu ameze nk’uko umutima wiwe ugomba ngo amwimike abe umurongozi w’abantu biwe, kuko utumviye ico <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagutegetse.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Nuko Samweli ava i Gilugali aduga i Gibeya mu ntara ya Benyamini. Sawuli aharura abasoda bari bakiri kumwe na we, asanga ni hafi amajana atandatu.<verse eid="1SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli babura ibigwanisho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Sawuli n’umuhungu wiwe Yonatani hamwe n’abasoda bari kumwe na bo bacumbika i Gibeya mu ntara ya Benyamini, mu gihe Abafilisitiya bari bacumbitse i Mikimashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Umusi umwe, umugwi w’abasoda b’Abafilisitiya b’abahinga mu kugwana urasohoka uva aho ingabo zabo zicumbitse, bigabura mu mice itatu. Umuce umwe ugenda utumbereye i Ofura mu karere ka Shuwali, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />uwundi uja i Beti-Horoni, uwa gatatu ugenda werekeye ku rubibe, haruguru y’ikiyaya c’i Zeboyime aharabana n’ubugaragwa.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Muri ico gihe nta mucuzi yaboneka mu gihugu ca Isirayeli, kuko Abafilisitiya bavuga bati: “Abaheburayo bohava bacura inkota canke amacumu!” <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Ni co gituma Abisirayeli bose iyo bakeneye gukarisha isuka inka zirimisha, isuka isanzwe, incabiti canke umuhoro, babijana ku bacuzi b’Abafilisitiya. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Igiciro cari bibiri vya bitatu vya shekeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 8.</char></note> kugira ngo bakarishe isuka inka zirimisha, isuka isanzwe; n’ica gatatu ca shekeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 4.</char></note> kugira ngo bakarishe incabiti, umuhoro, canke kugira ngo basongore ikimito.<verse eid="1SA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Nuko ku musi w’intambara nta musoda n’umwe mu bari kumwe na Sawuli canke Yonatani yari afise inkota canke icumu mu minwe. Sawuli n’umuhungu wiwe Yonatani bonyene ni bo bari babifise.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yonatani atera Abafilisitiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Hanyuma umuce umwe w’Abafilisitiya uja gutegera ku nzira ica i Mikimashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Umusi umwe Yonatani mwene Sawuli abwira umuhungu yamutwaza ibigwanisho ati: “Ingo, tuje ku kirindiro c’Abafilisitiya hariya hakurya.” Ariko ntiyabibwira se wiwe.<verse eid="1SA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Sawuli yari ku rubibe rw’i Gibeya yicaye musi y’igiti c’amakomamanga kiri i Miguroni. Yari kumwe n’abasoda amajana atandatu, <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />muri bo harimwo Ahiya, yari yambaye Efodi. Ahiya yari mwene Ahitubu yavukana na Ikabodi mwene Finehasi, Finehasi mwene Eli, umuherezi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> w’i Shilo. Mu basoda, nta n’umwe yigeze amenya ko Yonatani yagiye.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Mu kuja kuri ico kirindiro c’Abafilisitiya, Yonatani yari yaciye mu nzira iri hagati y’ibitandara bibiri, kimwe citwa Bozezi, ikindi Senehi. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Kimwe cari mu buraruko werekeye i Mikimashi, ikindi mu bumanuko werekeye i Gibeya.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonatani abwira wa musore amutwaza ibigwanisho ati: “Ingo tujabuke hakurya kuri kirya kirindiro ca zirya ntakebwa. Kumbure <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yogira ico adukoreye. Nta cobuza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> gukiza abantu, akoresheje benshi canke akoresheje bake.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Uwo amutwaza ibigwanisho aramubwira ati: “Kora ico wumva kibereye, nanje ndi kumwe nawe muri vyose.”<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonatani aravuga ati: “Ingo rero tujabuke dutumbereye barya bagabo kandi tugende batubona. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Nibatubwira bati: ‘Rindira tubasange aho mugeze,’ duca tuguma aho tugeze, ntitubasangayo. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Ariko nibatubwira bati: ‘Nimuduge mudusange ino,’ duca tuduga, kuko kizoba ari ikimenyetso ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abagabuye mu maboko yacu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Nuko bompi bagenda abari ku kirindiro c’Abafilisitiya bababona. Abafilisitiya baravuga bati: “Ehe Abaheburayo bariko baranyeguruka bava mu myobo bari binyegejemwo.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Ba bantu bari kuri ico kirindiro barasemerera babwira Yonatani n’uwari amutwaje ibigwanisho bati: “Nimuduge hano tubereke!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Nuko Yonatani abwira umwe amutwaje ibigwanisho ati: “Nkurikira tuduge; <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abagabuye mu maboko y’Abisirayeli.”<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Yonatani aduga aharamba n’amaboko n’amaguru, umwe amutwaje ibigwanisho amukurikiye. Yonatani agenda atera Abafilisitiya bagwa imbere yiwe, umwe amutwaje ibigwanisho na we akagenda arabahohosha. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Muri ico gitero ca mbere Yonatani n’uwari amutwaje ibigwanisho bica abagabo mirongo ibiri, imivyimba yabo yandagara ahantu hangana n’ahorimwa n’inka zibiri ku musi.<verse eid="1SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli bakinagiza Abafilisitiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Maze ubwoba bufata ingabo zose z’Abafilisitiya: abasigaye aho bacumbitse, abari mu mirima, abari ku birindiro hamwe n’imice yagiye gutera yose. Isi iranyiganyiga, haba ubwoba bukomeye burungitswe n’Imana.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Abareretsi ba Sawuli bari i Gibeya mu ntara ya Benyamini babona ingabo z’Abafilisitiya ziruka zishwiragira impande zose. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Nuko Sawuli abwira abari kumwe na we ati: “Koranya ingabo zose turabe uwatuvuyemwo.” Baravye, basanga Yonatani n’uwumutwaza ibigwanisho ni bo bari babuze.<verse eid="1SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Sawuli abwira Ahiya ati: “Zana Isandugu y’Imana.” (Muri ico gihe yari ifiswe n’Abisirayeli.) <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Sawuli akivugana n’umuherezi, urwamo rurushaho kuba rwinshi mu ngabo z’Abafilisitiya. Nuko Sawuli abwira wa muherezi Ahiya ati: “Isigireho kwinginga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="1SA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Nuko Sawuli n’ingabo zari kumwe na we barakorana baja kugwana. Basanga Abafilisitiya bari mu muvurungano ukomeye, umwe wese acumita inkota mugenziwe. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Mbere n’Abaheburayo bari bagiye kwishikana ku Bafilisitiya kandi bari kumwe na bo aho bacumbitse barahindukira baja ku ruhande rw’Abisirayeli bari kumwe na Sawuli na Yonatani. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Abisirayeli bari binyegeje mu karere k’imisozi k’Abefurayimu bumvise ko Abafilisitiya bariko barahunga, babaja inyuma barabagwanya. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Nuko kuri uwo musi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atabara Abisirayeli, kandi urugamba rurabandanya gushika barenze i Beti-Aveni.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yonatani arya ubuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Kuri uwo musi Abisirayeli bari bacitse intege kubera kuruha, kuko Sawuli yari yarahije abantu ati: “Aravumwe umuntu aza kugira ico arya butarira, ntarihora abansi banje!” Rero nta muntu n’umwe mu bari ku rugamba yigeze agira ico ashira ku munwa.<verse eid="1SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Ingabo zose zirenguka ahantu hari ishamba, zisanga hatemba ubuki. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Binjiye mw’ishamba, babona ubuki buriko buratemba, kandi ata n’umwe yigeze abukorako ngo ashire ku munwa, kuko batinya ya ndahiro. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Ariko Yonatani we ntiyari yumvise ko se yarahije abantu, aca ashira inkoni yari yitwaje mu kimamara c’ubuki. Araheza aratamira, intege ziragaruka. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Umwe mu bakuru b’ingabo aramubwira ati: “So yarahije ingabo zose ngo: ‘Aravumwe umuntu wese aza kugira ico ariye uwu musi!’ Ni co gituma abantu bacitse intege.”<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonatani aravuga ati: “Data yateye amakuba mu gihugu. Raba ingene intege zigarutse maze kurigata kuri ubu buki. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Mbega ntivyari kuba vyiza kurushiriza iyo abantu baba bariye ku vyo banyaze abansi babo? Kandi tuba twarushirijeho kunesha Abafilisitiya.”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Kuri uwo musi, Abisirayeli bamaze kunesha Abafilisitiya kuva i Mikimashi gushika i Ayaloni, bagera aho bacika intege kubera kuruha. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Nuko basimbira ku vyo basahuye, bafata intama, amashuri n’inyana z’inka, babibagira aho nyene bari, baca babirya bikirimwo amaraso. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Umuntu umwe abwira Sawuli ati: “Ehe raba abantu bariko baracumura k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuko bariko bararya inyama zikirimwo amaraso.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Sawuli aravuga ati: “Mwahemutse! Nimunyarukane ibuye rinini hano ubu nyene.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Nuko aravuga ati: “Nimugende murondere abantu mubabwire umuntu wese azane hano inka yiwe canke intama yiwe, babibagire kandi babirire hano. Nimureke gucumura k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu kurya inyama zikirimwo amaraso.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:34">Nuko umuntu wese azana ishuri yiwe muri iryo joro ayibagira ngaho. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Maze Sawuli yubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igicaniro; kandi bwari ubwa mbere akora atyo.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Sawuli aravuga ati: “Nimuze tumanuke dukurikire Abafilisitiya mw’ijoro tubanyage ivyabo gushika mu mutwenzi, kandi ntidusigaze n’umwe ari muzima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Na bo barishura bati: “Nukore ivyo ubona ko ari vyiza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Ariko umuherezi aravuga ati: “Reka dusigurize Imana ngaha nyene.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Nuko Sawuli abaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Mbega manuke nkurikire Abafilisitiya? Urabagabura mu maboko y’Abisirayeli?” Ariko Imana ntiyamwishura kuri uwo musi.<verse eid="1SA 14:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Nuko Sawuli aravuga ati: “Nimuze hano mwebwe mwese murongoye abasoda, kugira ngo tugire ubupfindo tumenye icaha cakozwe uwu musi. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Kandi ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atabara Abisirayeli, naho yoba ari umwana wanje Yonatani, ategerezwa gupfa.” Ariko nta n’umwe mu bantu yagize ico avuga.<verse eid="1SA 14:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Nuko Sawuli abwira Abisirayeli bose ati: “Nimuhagarare harya; nanje n’umuhungu wanje Yonatani duhagarare hano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Abantu barishura bati: “Nukore ikiguhimbaye cose.”<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Nuko Sawuli asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli ati: “Ni igiki catumye utanyishura jewe umusavyi wawe uno musi? Nimba vyavuye ku caha nakoze canke umuhungu wanje Yonatani yakoze, ndakwinginze wishure na Urimu, ariko nimba vyavuye ku caha c’abasoda ba Isirayeli, ndakwinginze wishure na Tumimu.” Maze Yonatani na Sawuli baba ari bo bafatwa n’ubupfindo, abasoda bo barera. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Sawuli aravuga ati: “Mugire ubupfindo hagati yanje na Yonatani umuhungu wanje.” Maze Yonatani aba ari we afatwa.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Maze Sawuli abwira Yonatani ati: “Mbwira ico wakoze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Yonatani aramubwira ati: “Narigase ubuki bukeya ndabuhakuje inkoni yanje. None ntegerezwa gupfa!”<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Sawuli aravuga ati: “Imana ize ibimpore mbere birushirije, nutapfa, Yonatani.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Ariko abasoda baravuga bati: “Mbega Yonatani yopfa ari we yazanye ugutabarwa kungana gutya mu Bisirayeli? Ntibikabe! Turahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nta n’agashatsi ko ku mutwe wiwe kaza gukorokera hasi, kuko yakoze ivyo uno musi afashijwe n’Imana.” Nuko abantu bakiza Yonatani batyo, maze ntiyicwa.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Nuko Sawuli areka gukurikira Abafilisitiya, na bo basubira mu gihugu cabo.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Kuva Sawuli ahawe kuganza Abisirayeli, yagwanye n’abansi b’impande zose: Abanyamowabu, Abamoni, Abanyedomu, abami b’i Zoba, n’Abafilisitiya. Kandi aho yaja kugwana hose, yama atahukana intsinzi. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Yagwananye ubuhizi anesha Abamaleki, akura Abisirayeli mu maboko y’abari barabanyaze ivyabo.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umuryango wa Sawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Bene Sawuli bari Yonatani, Ishuvi na Maluki-Shuwa. Umukobwa wiwe mukuru yitwa Merabi, mutoya na we yitwa Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Umugore wiwe yitwa Ahinowamu umukobwa wa Ahimazi. Umukuru w’ingabo za Sawuli yitwa Abuneri mwene Neri, Neri na we yari sewabo wa Sawuli. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Kishi se wa Sawuli na Neri se wa Abuneri bari bene Abiyeli.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Imyaka yose Sawuli yamaze ku ngoma yari iy’intambara zikomeye yagwanye n’Abafilisitiya, kandi igihe cose Sawuli yabona umuntu w’intwari canke w’umuhizi, yaca amushira mu ngabo ziwe.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yanka ko Sawuli ashishikara kuba umwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Umusi umwe, Samweli abwira Sawuli ati: “Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatumye kukurobanuza amavuta ngo ube umwami w’abantu biwe b’Abisirayeli; niwumve rero ijambo ngiye kukubwira rivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze: ‘Ngomba guhana Abamaleki kubera ivyo bakoreye Abisirayeli igihe babategera mu nzira bavuye muri Egiputa. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Nuko rero genda utere Abamaleki kandi urandure ikintu cose. Ntihagire ico usigaza; wice abagabo n’abagore, abana n’inzoya, inka n’intama, ingamiya n’indogoba.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Nuko Sawuli atumako abagize ingabo bose, abakoraniriza i Telayimu, bose hamwe bari abasoda ibihumbi amajana abiri bavuye mu miryango ya Isirayeli hamwe n’ibihumbi cumi bavuye mu muryango wa Yuda wonyene. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Nuko Sawuli ajana n’ingabo ziwe gutera igisagara c’Abamaleki, binyegeza mu mwonga kugira ngo babatere giturumbuka. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Maze abwira Abakayini ati: “Mwebwe nimwitandukanye n’Abamaleki kugira ngo ntimuranduranwe na bo; kuko mwagiriye neza Abisirayeli igihe bava muri Egiputa.” Nuko Abakayini bitandukanya n’Abamaleki.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Hanyuma Sawuli atera Abamaleki kuva i Havila gushika i Shuri, mu buseruko bwa Egiputa. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Afata Agagi umwami w’Abamaleki, abantu biwe bose abaranduza inkota. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Ariko Sawuli n’ingabo ziwe basigaza Agagi n’ibitungwa vyizavyiza vyo mu ntama n’inka, inyana zivyibushe n’imyagazi y’intama, eka ibintu vyose vyiza, ibikengeretse n’ibinyantegenke vyose baba ari vyo barandura.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Samweli ati: <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Ndicujije icatumye nimika Sawuli ngo abe umwami, kuko yanteye ibitugu ntakurikize ivyo namutegetse.” Samweli arababara cane, atakambira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> iryo joro ryose.<verse eid="1SA 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Mu gitondo ca kare Samweli aravyuka aja kubonana na Sawuli, ariko baramubwira bati: “Sawuli yagiye i Karumeli gushinga icibutso ciwe co kumuhesha icubahiro hanyuma aca aramanuka aja i Gilugali.”<verse eid="1SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Samweli amushikiriye, Sawuli amubwira ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aguhezagire! Ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yantegetse gukora vyose, nabikoze.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Samweli aramwishura ati: “None ko numva ukwabira kw’intama n’inka mu matwi yanje?”<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sawuli aramwishura ati: “Ni intama n’inka nziza kurusha izindi abasoda basigaje barabizana babikuye mu Bamaleki kugira ngo babishikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe, ariko ibindi vyose twarabiranduye turabimara.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Samweli abwira Sawuli ati: “Geza aho! Nyumviriza nkubwire ico <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaraye ambwiye muri iri joro rikeye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Sawuli aramwishura ati: “Mbwira.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samweli amubwira ati: “Naho wewe nyene wari wariravye ukikengera, mbega ntiwabaye umurongozi w’imiryango yose y’Abisirayeli? <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarakurobanuje amavuta ngo ube umwami w’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Kandi yaragutumye, arakubwira ati: ‘Genda urandure abo bantu babi b’Abamaleki, ubagwanye gushika ubamaze bose.’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />None ni iki catumye utumvira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>? Ni kuki wagurukiye ku vyanyazwe ugakora ikintu kibi nk’ico mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Ariko Sawuli ashishikara avuga ati: “Narakoze igikorwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yantumye. Naranduye Abamaleki bose, mfata n’umwami wabo Agagi ndamuzana. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Abasoda ni bo bafashe intama n’inka mu vyanyazwe, ivyo babonye ko ari vyiza kurusha ibindi kugira ngo babishikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe kw’ibimazi i Gilugali.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Ariko Samweli aramwishura ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">“Mbega <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahimbarwa n’amashikanwa atongozwa umuriro n’ibimazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">kuruta kumwumvira no gukora ico yategetse?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Nyumviriza! Kwumvira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> biruta ibimazi, kandi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">kwumvira ico yavuze biruta amapfizi y’intama anuze.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Kuko kugarariza ari co kimwe n’icaha c’ubupfumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">kandi ukutumvira, ni co kimwe n’ugusenga ibigirwamana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">Ko wanse kwumvira ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">na we yanse ko ubandanya uri umwami.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Nuko Sawuli abwira Samweli ati: “Ni vyo, nacumuye. Nanse kwumvira ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yantegetse n’ivyo yanyihanikirije. Natinye abantu nca ndabemerera gukora ivyo bashaka. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />None rero, ndakwinginze, mparira icaha canje, hanyuma uze dusubirane inyuma, kugira ngo nje gusenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Ariko Samweli aramubwira ati: “Sinsubirana inyuma nawe. Wanse kwumvira ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we yanse ko uba umwami w’Abisirayeli!”<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Samweli ahindukiye ngo agende, Sawuli amufata ku musozo w’ikanzu yambaye ica iratabuka. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Samweli aca amubwira ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atabuye ubwami bwa Isirayeli arabukwatse kuva uwu musi, abuhaye uwundi akurusha ubutwari. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Uhoraho, we Cubahiro ca Isirayeli, ntiyigera abesha kandi ntiyivuguruza; kuko si umwana w’umuntu ngo aje arihindukiza mw’ijambo.”<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Sawuli aramwishura ati: “Ni vyo nacumuye. Ariko ndakwinginze ntera iteka imbere y’aba bakuru b’abantu banje n’imbere y’Abisirayeli; garuka tujane, kugira ngo nsenge <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe.” <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Nuko Samweli asubiranayo na Sawuli, Sawuli asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Maze Samweli aravuga ati: “Nzanira Agagi umwami w’Abamaleki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:32">Maze Agagi aza aho Samweli ari aremye, yibaza ati: “Singipfuye.”<verse eid="1SA 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Ariko Samweli aravuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:33">“Nk’uko inkota yawe yahekuye abavyeyi benshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:33">ni ko na nyoko abaye umwe muri abo bagore bahekuwe.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1SA 15:33">Maze Samweli ahimbagurira Agagi aho nyene imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Gilugali.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Nuko Samweli asubira i Rama, ariko Sawuli araduga aja iwe i Gibeya. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Samweli ntiyigeze asubira kubonana na Sawuli kugeza apfuye, naho yagandaye kubera umubabaro w’ivyabaye kuri Sawuli. Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaricujije icatumye yimika Sawuli ngo abe umwami w’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Samweli arobanuza amavuta Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Samweli ati: “Mbega uzogeza ryari kugandarira Sawuli, uwo nanse ko aba umwami w’Abisirayeli? Uzuza amavuta ihembe ryawe uce ufata inzira; uje kwa Isayi, i Betelehemu. Natoranije umwe mu bahungu biwe ngo abe umwami.”<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Ariko Samweli aravuga ati: “Mbega nobigenza gute? Sawuli avyumvise yonyica.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amubwira ati: “Uze ujane ishashi y’inka uvuge uti: ‘Nje gushikanira ikimazi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Uze utumire Isayi aze ku kimazi, hanyuma nanje nzokubwira ico uri bukore. Uze urobanuze amavuta uwo nzokwereka.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samweli akora nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amubariye. Ashitse i Betelehemu, abakuru b’igisagara bahagarika umutima bamubonye. Baramubaza bati: “Uzanywe n’amahoro?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samweli arabishura ati: “Egome ni amahoro; nzanywe no gushikanira ikimazi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Nimwiyeze muze dutange ikimazi.” Nuko yeza Isayi n’abahungu biwe abatumira ku kimazi.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Bashitse, Samweli abona Eliyabu, maze ariyumvira ati: “Ni ukuri uwu ni we <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatoranije.”<verse eid="1SA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramubwira ati: “Nturabe akaranga n’uburebure, uwo namwanse. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntaraba ku vyo abantu baraba. Abantu baraba ku biboneka, ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> araba mu mutima.”<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Nuko Isayi ahamagara Abinadabu amucisha imbere ya Samweli. Ariko Samweli aravuga ati: “N’uwu si we <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahisemwo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Isayi azana Shama, Samweli aravuga ati: “N’uwu na we si we <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahisemwo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Isayi acisha abahungu biwe indwi imbere ya Samweli, ariko Samweli aramubwira ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyahisemwo n’umwe muri aba.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Nuko aramubaza ati: “Aba ni bo bahungu ufise?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Isayi aramwishura ati: “Harasigaye umuhererezi, kandi ubu ari kuragira intama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Samweli aramubwira ati: “Mutumeko; kuko tuticara ngo dufungure atarashika.”<verse eid="1SA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Nuko amutumako araza. Yari umusore akeye mu maso, afise amaso meza kandi w’akaranga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:12">Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Haguruka umusukeko amavuta; ni uwo nyene.”<verse eid="1SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Maze Samweli yakira rya hembe ry’amavuta ayamusukako bakuru biwe babona, kandi kuva uwo musi n’inyuma y’aho Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yama aza kuri Dawidi azananye ubushobozi. Nuko Samweli asubira i Rama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi akorera Sawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Ico gihe, Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari amaze kuva kuri Sawuli, maze impwemu mbi itumwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikaza ikamubuza amahoro.<verse eid="1SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Abishikira ba Sawuli baragenda bamubwira bati: “Ehe raba impwemu mbi ivuye ku Mana irakubujije amahoro. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Reka, turondere umuntu ashobora kukuvugiriza inanga. Azoja arayivuza igihe cose iyo mpwemu mbi itumwe n’Imana igufashe, kandi kuva ako kanya uzoca umererwa neza.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Nuko Sawuli abwira abo bishikira biwe ati: “Ndonderera uwo muntu azi kuvuza neza inanga mumunzanire.”<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Umwe mu bakozi biwe aravuga ati: “Narabonye umwe muri bene Isayi w’i Betelehemu azi kuvuza inanga neza. Ni umuntu w’intwari, akerebutse w’umuhizi mu ntambara. Avuga neza, ni umunyakaranga kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe na we.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Nuko Sawuli arungika intumwa kwa Isayi amutumako ati: “Ndungikira umuhungu wawe Dawidi, aragira intama.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Nuko Isayi afata indogoba ayiremeka imikate, umukuza w’umuvinyu n’ishashi y’impene abirungikana umuhungu wiwe Dawidi kwa Sawuli.<verse eid="1SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Dawidi ashitse kwa Sawuli atangura kumukorera. Sawuli aramukunda cane, maze Dawidi aca aba umwe mu bamutwaza ibigwanisho. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Nuko Sawuli arungikira ubutumwa Isayi amubwira ati: “Unyememerere Dawidi agume ankorera, kuko arampimbara.”<verse eid="1SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Igihe cose ya mpwemu yatumwe n’Imana yaza kuri Sawuli, Dawidi yaca afata inanga yiwe akayivuza. Maze Sawuli agaca amererwa neza, kandi iyo mpwemu na yo igaca imuvako.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi yica Goliyati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Hanyuma Abafilisitiya bakoranya ingabo zabo kugira ngo bagwane, bakoranira i Soko mu Buyuda, bacumbika i Efesi-Damimu, hagati y’i Soko n’i Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sawuli n’Abisirayeli na bo barakorana bacumbika mu kiyaya ca Ela, batonda urugamba ngo bagwanye Abafilisitiya. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Nuko Abafilisitiya bahagarara ku musozi umwe, Abisirayeli na bo bahagarara ku wundi, hagati yabo hakaba ikiyaya.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Maze haza umuhizi mu ntambara yitwa Goliyati, Umufilisitiya yaturuka i Gati, asokoroka mu ngabo z’Abafilisitiya. Yari afise nk’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 3.</char></note> z’uburebure. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Ku mutwe yari yambaye inkofero icuzwe mu muringa, mu gikiriza na ho yari yambaye icuma co kumukingira gifise ibigaragamba gicuzwe mu muringa nyene gipima shekeli ibihumbi bitanu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo mirongo 58.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Ku maguru yari yambaye ivyuma vyo kuyakingira bicuzwe mu muringa, yitwaje n’icumu ricuzwe mu muringa ku bitugu. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Icumu ryiwe ryari rikwikiye mu giti kingana n’ico kujishirako impuzu, icuma caryo na co kigapima shekeli amajana atandatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 6,9.</char></note> Uwamutwaza inkinzo yamugendera imbere.<verse eid="1SA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Nuko Goliyati arahagarara, arasemerera abwira ingabo z’Abisirayeli ati: “Ni kuki mutonze urugamba? Jewe ndi umuhizi w’Umufilisitiya, namwe muri abagurano ba Sawuli? Nimuhitemwo umuntu umwe muri mwebwe amanuke aze duhure tugwane. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Niyashobora kungwanya akanyica, tuzoca tuba abagurano banyu; ariko ninamunesha nkamwica, muzoca muba abagurano bacu mudukorere.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Nuko uwo Mufilisitiya arongera aravuga ati: “Uwu musi ingabo zose za Isirayeli ndazihaye ikibazo! Nimumpe umuntu aze tugwane.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Uko bumvise amajambo y’uwo Mufilisitiya kwose, Sawuli n’Abisirayeli bose baca bacika ivutu bakagira ubwoba bwinshi.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Dawidi, yari umwe mu bahungu b’umuntu wo mu ntara ya Efurata yitwa Isayi, yaba i Betelehemu mu Buyuda. Isayi yari afise abahungu umunani, kandi mu gihe ca Sawuli we yari ashaje cane. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Abahungu ba Isayi batatu bakuru bari bajanye na Sawuli ku rugamba: imfura yitwa Eliyabu, uwa kabiri Abinadabu, n’uwa gatatu Shama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Dawidi ni we yari umuhererezi. Abo batatu bakuru bari bajanye na Sawuli ku rugamba, <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />ariko Dawidi we yaja aragenda yongera agaruka, akava kwa Sawuli akaja kuragira intama za se i Betelehemu.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Nuko uwo Mufilisitiya amara imisi mirongo ine, asokoroka igitondo n’umugoroba agahagarara imbere y’ingabo z’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Umusi umwe, Isayi abwira umuhungu wiwe Dawidi ati: “Akira iyi ngero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 16.</char></note> y’ingano zikaranze n’iyi mikate icumi ubishire bakuru bawe iyo bari ku rugamba kandi wihute. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Utware n’izo foromaji icumi uzishire umukuru w’ingabo abarongoye. Urabe uko bakuru bawe bamerewe, hanyuma unzanire inkuru y’ingene bameze. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Bakuru ba Dawidi bari kumwe na Sawuli hamwe n’abagabo b’Abisirayeli bose mu kiyaya Ela, bagwana n’Abafilisitiya.”<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Mu gatondo ka kare Dawidi asigarana uwundi mwungere imikuku, atekera vya bintu aragenda, nk’uko se Isayi yamubwiye. Nuko ashika aho bacumbitse mu gihe ingabo zariko ziratonda urugamba, bavuza akamo k’intambara. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Abisirayeli n’Abafilisitiya bariko baregerana bashaka kurumana ngo bagwane. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Dawidi asigarana bimwe yajanye umurinzi w’ibikoresho, yiruka ku rugamba kuramutsa bakuru biwe no kubabaza amakuru yabo. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Akiriko araganira na bo, Goliyati, wa muhizi w’Umufilisitiya w’i Gati, yigira imbere ava aho abandi batonze urugamba bari, asubira gusemerera n’agakengerwe kenshi nk’uko yari asanzwe amenyereye kubikora. Maze Dawidi aravyumva. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Abisirayeli babonye uwo mugabo, bose baca barahunga kubera kumutinya.<verse eid="1SA 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Abisirayeli baguma bavugana ngo: “Murabona kirya kigabo ingene kiguma kiza? Kizanwa no gucokora Isirayeli. Umwami yaravuze ko yoha impera nini umuntu yomwica. Ngo yomuha umwe mu bakobwa biwe kandi inzu ya se ntiyosubira gutanga ikori mu miryango yose ya Isirayeli.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Dawidi abaza abari bamwegereye ati: “Uwokwica uwo Mufilisitiya agakura agakengerwe ku Bisirayeli yokorerwa iki? Iyo ntakebwa y’Umufilisitiya yibaza ko ari iki, aho yubahuka gucokora ingabo z’Imana Nzima?”<verse eid="1SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Bamusubiriramwo vya bindi bamye bavuga bati: “Ivyo ni vyo umuntu yomwica yokorerwa.”<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Maze Eliyabu, mukuru wa Dawidi, yumva ariko aravugana na ba bantu, aca arashavura cane, amubaza ati: “Ni igiki cakuzanye hano? Ni nde wasigaranye twa dutama mu bugaragwa? Ndazi ukwishira hejuru kwawe n’ububi bwo mu mutima wawe; nta kindi cakuzanye atari ukuraba intambara.”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Dawidi aramwishura ati: “None jewe ngize iki? None no kuvuga simvuge?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Aca arimuka aja ku wundi muntu yongera kubaza ico kibazo nyene, bamwishura kwa kundi nyene. <verse eid="1SA 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Ivyo Dawidi yavuze bikwira hose bishikira na Sawuli, na we aca amutumako.<verse eid="1SA 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Dawidi abwira Sawuli ati: “Ntihagire umuntu asubira kuranduka umutima kubera uwo Mufilisitiya; jewe umusavyi wawe ngira nje kumugwanya.”<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sawuli aramwishura ati: “Ntushobora kuja kugwana n’urya Mufilisitiya; kuko uracari muto, ariko we yatanguye kugwana kuva kera akiri muto.”<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Ariko Dawidi yishura Sawuli ati: “Jewe umusavyi wawe nsanzwe ndagira intama za data. Iyo intambwe canke idubu ije kwiba intama yo mu mukuku, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />nca ndayikurikira, nkayigwanya, nkayiyikura mu kanwa. Yampindukirira, nkayifata mw’izosi nkayigwanya nkayica. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Jewe umusavyi wawe ko nishe intambwe n’idubu, n’uwo Mufilisitiya w’intakebwa araba nka kimwe muri ivyo, kuko yacokoye ingabo z’Imana nzima. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yantabaye akankura mu vyara vy’intambwe n’idubu arankura no mu kuboko kw’uwo Mufilisitiya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Sawuli abwira Dawidi ati: “Genda, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abane nawe.”<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Nuko Sawuli yambika Dawidi umwambaro wiwe. Amwambika n’ibigwanisho vyiwe, amuha n’inkofero yiwe y’umuringa yo kwambara ku mutwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Maze Dawidi ahagatira inkota ya Sawuli hejuru ya wa mwambaro, agerageza gutambuka biranka kuko atari abimenyereye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:39">Maze abwira Sawuli ati: “Sinshobora kugenda nambaye ibi bintu kuko sindabimenyereye.” Nuko arabikura. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Aca afata inkoni yiwe mu minwe, atora amabuye atanu yiburungushuye ku mugezi, ayashira mu gasaho kiwe k’abungere, ajana n’umugozi wiwe mu minwe, aca agenda atumbereye wa Mufilisitiya.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Goliyati wa Mufilisitiya na we aza guhura na Dawidi, umwe amutwaje inkinzo agendera imbere yiwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Aravye Dawidi akiri kure aramukengera, kuko yari akiri umuhungu muto cane, afise amagara meza kandi w’akaranga. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Abwira Dawidi ati: “Mbega mbaye imbwa, aho uza kungwanya witwaje inkoni?” Nuko wa Mufilisitiya atuka Dawidi mu mazina y’imana ziwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Aravuga ati: “Nuze hano, ndakubagire ibisiga n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba!”<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Dawidi na we abwira wa Mufilisitiya ati: “Uje kungwanya witwaje inkota n’icumu n’ikimito, ariko jeho nje kukugwanya mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Imana y’ingabo z’Abisirayeli wacokoye. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Uwu musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arakugabuye mu maboko yanje, ngira ndakwice ndaguce umutwe. Uwu musi imivyimba y’Abafilisitiya ngira ndayigaburire ibisiga vyo mu kirere n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba, kandi isi yose izomenya ko mu Bisirayeli hari Imana. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Kandi abakoraniye hano bose baramenya ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> adakirisha inkota canke icumu; kuko intambara ari iy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, arabagabura mu maboko yacu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Wa Mufilisitiya aramwegera ngo amugwanye, Dawidi na we yiruka aja iyo ari ngo bahure. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Akora muri ka gasaho atoramwo ibuye rimwe, arishira muri wa mugozi, arawuzungagiza, aritera wa Mufilisitiya mu ruhanga. Rya buye ryinjira mu gahanga kiwe, aca agwa hasi yubamye.<verse eid="1SA 17:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Nuko Dawidi anesha wa Mufilisitiya akoresheje umugozi n’ibuye rimwe; amutsinda hasi ata nkota afise, aramwica.<verse eid="1SA 17:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Dawidi ariruka amuhagarara hejuru. Afata ya nkota ya wa Mufilisitiya ayikura mu rwubati. Amaze kumwica, amuca umutwe na ya nkota yiwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Abafilisitiya babonye ko umuhizi wabo apfuye, barahindukira barahunga. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Nuko ingabo z’Abisirayeli n’Abayuda biha akamo bakurikira Abafilisitiya gushika kw’irembo ry’i Gati n’amarembo y’i Ekuroni. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Abisirayeli bavuye gukinagiza Abafilisitiya, basahura ibintu aho bari bacumbitse.<verse eid="1SA 17:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Dawidi atwara umutwe wa wa Mufilisitiya awujana i Yerusalemu, ashira ibigwanisho vya wa Mufilisitiya mw’ihema ryiwe.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Igihe Sawuli yabona Dawidi agiye guhura na Goliyati, yabajije Abuneri, umukuru w’ingabo, ati: “Mbega Abuneri, uwo muhungu ni mwene nde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abuneri aramwishura ati: “Ndahiye wewe nyene, mwami, sindamuzi.”<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Umwami aravuga ati: “Gerageza umenye se w’uwo muhungu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Dawidi avuye kwica wa Mufilisitiya, Abuneri amujana kwa Sawuli, agifise umutwe wa Goliyati mu ntoke.<verse eid="1SA 17:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sawuli aramubaza ati: “Muhungu, uri mwene nde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">Dawidi aramwishura ati: “Ndi umuhungu w’umusavyi wawe Isayi w’i Betelehemu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Sawuli agirira ishari Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Dawidi ahejeje kuvugana na Sawuli, Yonatani ahuza umutima wiwe n’uwa Dawidi, amukunda nk’uko yikunda. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Kuva ico gihe Sawuli aca agumya Dawidi ntiyasubira kumureka ngo asubire iwabo. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Maze Yonatani agirana isezerano na Dawidi kuko yamukunda nk’uko yikunda. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yonatani yambura ikanzu yiwe yari yambaye ayiha Dawidi, umuha n’impuzu ziwe z’intambara, mbere n’inkota yiwe, n’umuheto n’umukanda vyose arabimuha.<verse eid="1SA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Ico Sawuli yatuma Dawidi gukora cose, yaragikora kandi neza gushika aho Sawuli yamuhaye ikibanza kinini mu ngabo za Isirayeli. Ivyo bihimbara abantu bose, n’abakuru b’ingabo ba Sawuli.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Ingabo z’Abisirayeli igihe zariko zirataha Dawidi ahejeje kwica Goliyati, abagore bava mu bisagara vya Isirayeli baje guhura n’umwami Sawuli baza bavyina kandi batamba indirimbo z’umunezero bavuza utugoma n’ibindi bikoresho vyose bivuzwa mu kuririmba. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Bariko baravyina baririmba ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">“Sawuli yishe ibihumbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 18:7">Dawidi na we ibihumbi incuro icumi.”<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Urwo ruririmbo rushavuza Sawuli cane. Ariyumvira ati: “Dawidi bamuharuriye ibihumbi cumi, ariko jewe ni ibihumbi gusa. Mbega igisigaye ni iki, atari kumuha ubwami?” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Kuva ico gihe Sawuli agirira ishari Dawidi akamuraba ijisho ribi.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Bukeye impwemu mbi itumwe n’Imana iza kuri Sawuli amera nk’uwuriko avugishwa ibintu ari mu nzu iwe, Dawidi na we ariko aravuza inanga, nk’uko yahora abikora. Sawuli yari afise icumu mu minwe <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />aca ararimutera, yibwira ati: “Ngomba ntobekeranye Dawidi afatane n’igihome.” Ariko Dawidi ararizibukira kabiri kose.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Kuva ico gihe Sawuli aca atinya Dawidi, kuko yarabona ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe na we, mugabo we akaba azi ko yamuhevye. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Maze arungika Dawidi kure yiwe amuha kuganza abasoda igihumbi. Dawidi akama ajana ingabo ku rugamba azigiye imbere. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Ivyo yakora vyose vyagenda neza, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari kumwe na we. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Sawuli amaze kubona ko ivyo akora vyose bitera imbere, arushaho kumutinya. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Ariko Abisirayeli n’Abayuda bose bagakunda Dawidi, kuko yajana na bo ku rugamba abarongoye.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Sawuli abwira Dawidi ati: “Ng’uwu umukobwa wanje mukuru Merabi. Ndamugushingira; ariko ubanze unkorere ushizeko umwete, ugwane intambara z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” Vyatumwa n’uko Sawuli yibwira mu mutima ati: “Singomba kumukozako ukuboko ngo ndamwice, reka Abafilisitiya abe ari bo bamwica!”<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Ariko Dawidi yishura Sawuli ati: “Mbega jewe ndi iki canke umuryango wa data mu Bisirayeli, aho noba umukwe w’umwami?” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Maze igihe kigeze ko Merabi umukobwa wa Sawuli ashingirwa Dawidi, ahabwa Adiriyeli w’i Mehola.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Maze Mikali umukobwa wa Sawuli akunda Dawidi, bamaze kubibwira Sawuli, aranezerwa. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Ariyumvira ati: “Nzomumuha, maze amubere umutego kugira ngo aze agwe mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya.” Nuko Sawuli abwira Dawidi ati: “Uronse akandi karyo ka kabiri ko kuba umukwe w’umwami.”<verse eid="1SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Nuko Sawuli avugana n’abishikira biwe ati: “Muvugane na Dawidi mw’ibanga mumubwire muti: ‘Umwami arakunezererwa, kandi n’abishikira biwe twese turagukunda; none rero niwemere ube umukwe wiwe.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Babwira Dawidi ayo majambo. Ariko Dawidi abishura ati: “Mbega mwibaza ko ari ikintu coroshe kuronka inkwano no kuba umukwe w’umwami? Jewe ndi umukene kandi nta co maze.”<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Ba bishikira ba Sawuli bamubwiye ivyo Dawidi yavuze, <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sawuli arishura ati: “Mubwire Dawidi muti: ‘Umwami ntashaka inkwano n’imwe yindi atari udukoba tw’ibitsina gabo vy’Abafilisitiya ijana, kugira ngo yihore abansi biwe.’ ” Mu mugambi wa Sawuli kwari ukugira ngo Dawidi ahitanwe n’Abafilisitiya.<verse eid="1SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Ba bakozi bamaze kubwira Dawidi ivyo vyose, aca aremera kuba umukwe w’umwami. Nuko imbere y’uko igihe yahawe gihera, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Dawidi n’abantu biwe baragenda bica Abafilisitiya amajana abiri. Aca azana igitigiri gikwiye ca twa dukoba tw’Abafilisitiya abiha umwami kugira ngo ashobore kuba umukwe w’umwami. Maze Sawuli aca amushingira umukobwa wiwe Mikali.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Sawuli abonye ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe na Dawidi, kandi ko umukobwa wiwe Mikali amukunda, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Sawuli aca arushaho gutinya Dawidi, hanyuma aca amugira umwansi wiwe mu misi yose yari ashigaje kubaho.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Abakuru b’ingabo z’Abafilisitiya bashishikara gutera Isirayeli, kandi igihe cose batera, Dawidi yama abanesha akarusha abandi bakuru b’ingabo bose ba Sawuli, maze izina ryiwe riba rurangiranwa.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Sawuli agerageza kwica Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sawuli abwira umuhungu wiwe Yonatani na ba bishikira biwe ngo bice Dawidi. Ariko Yonatani yarakunda cane Dawidi. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Aca aramugabisha ati: “Data Sawuli ariko ararondera akaryo ko kukwica. Nuko wirinde kandi ejo mu gitondo uze urabe aho winyegeza mu mirima ugumeyo. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Nanje nzosohokana na data duhagararane muri uwo murima aho uzoba uri. Nzovugana na we ivyawe hanyuma mpeze nkubwire uko ibintu bizoba bimeze.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Nuko Yonatani avuga neza Dawidi imbere ya Sawuli aramubwira ati: “Umwami ntakwiye gucumura ku mukozi wiwe Dawidi, nta kibi na kimwe aragukorera; kandi ivyo yakoze vyose vyakuzaniye inyungu ihambaye. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Yahevye ubuzima bwiwe igihe yica Goliyati. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aha Abisirayeli bose intsinzi ikomeye, kandi warabibonye kandi vyarakunezereye. None ni iki gituma ugomba kwica umuntu nka Dawidi ata kibi yakugiriye kandi udafise igituma?”<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Maze Sawuli yumviriza Yonatani aca ararahira ati: “Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Dawidi ntazokwicwa.”<verse eid="1SA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Nuko Yonatani ahamagara Dawidi amubwira ivy’ico kiyago vyose. Amuzana aho Sawuli ari, Dawidi asubira kubana na Sawuli nk’ubwa mbere.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Hanyuma intambara isubira kwaduka, Dawidi aja kugwanya Abafilisitiya. Arabagwanya kugeza aho bahunga imbere yiwe.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Ariko impwemu mbi itumwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> iza kuri Sawuli aho yari yicaye mu nzu yiwe afise icumu mu minwe. Dawidi akivuza inanga, <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sawuli amutera rya cumu ariko Dawidi ararizibukira, rica ryinjira mu gihome. Kuri uwo musi Dawidi aca ahenga mw’ijoro arahunga.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Sawuli atuma abantu kwa Dawidi ngo bamuryamire maze bamwice mu gitondo bukeye. Ariko Mikali muka Dawidi aramuburira ati: “Niyo utahunga iri joro, ejo mu gitondo uzokwicwa.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Nuko Mikali acisha Dawidi mw’idirisha, aratoroka arahunga. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Maze Mikali afata ikigirwamana c’umuryango akirambika ku buriri, agipfukisha impuzu agishirako ubwoya bw’impene ku mutwe.<verse eid="1SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Sawuli atumye ba bantu ngo bafate Dawidi, Mikali aravuga ati: “Aragwaye.”<verse eid="1SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Nuko Sawuli arongera arabatuma ngo basubire kuraba Dawidi ababwira ati: “Mumunzanire ari ku buriri aryamyeko kugira ngo ndamwice.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Ariko ba bantu binjiye, basangamwo ca kigirwamana, ku mutwe hariko ubwoya bw’impene.<verse eid="1SA 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Sawuli abwira Mikali ati: “Ni kuki wampenze nk’uko ugatuma umwansi wanje ancika agahunga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Mikali aramubwira ati: “Yambwiye ati: ‘Reka ngende. Ni iki cotuma nkwica?’ ”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Dawidi amaze guhunga aca aja kwa Samweli i Rama amubwira ivyo Sawuli yamugiriye vyose. Maze baca baja i Nayoti bagumayo. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Umuntu araza abwira Sawuli ati: “Dawidi ari i Nayoti i Rama”; <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Maze arungika abantu ngo bamufate. Ariko babonye umugwi w’abavugishwa bariko baravugishwa, na Samweli ahagaze ari we abarongoye, Mpwemu w’Imana aza kuri ba bantu ba Sawuli batangura kuvugishwa. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Babibwira Sawuli, maze arungika abandi, na bo baravugishwa. Sawuli arungika abandi ubwa gatatu, na bo baravugishwa. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Mu nyuma aba ari we yigira i Rama aca aja ku kinogo kibika amazi c’i Seku. Maze arabaza ati: “Samweli na Dawidi bari he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:22">Baramwishura bati: “Bari i Nayoti i Rama.”<verse eid="1SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Nuko Sawuli aja i Nayoti i Rama. Ariko Mpwemu w’Imana amuzako, agenda aravugishwa kugeza ashitse i Nayoti. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Aca yiyambura impuzu ziwe, avugishirizwa mu maso ya Samweli. Aguma gutyo yambaye ubusa ijoro n’umurango. Ni co gituma abantu babibonye babaza bati: “Mbega harya na Sawuli ari mu bavugishwa n’Imana?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi na Yonatani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Maze Dawidi arahunga ava i Nayoti i Rama, aja kwa Yonatani aramubaza ati: “Mbega nakoze iki? Icaha canje ni ikihe? Ikibi nakoreye so ni ikihe, ko agomba kunyica?”<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonatani amwishura ati: “Ntibikabe. Ntuzopfa! Data ntiyigera akora ikintu, caba gito canke kinini, atambwiye. None ivyo yobimpisha gute? Si vyo!”<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Ariko Dawidi aramurahira ati: “So arazi neza ko nagize ikiganza ciza imbere yawe, maze aca aribwira ati: ‘Yonatani ntakwiye kubimenya kuko yobabara.’ Naho biri uko ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi nawe ndakurahiye, nsigaje gatoya ngapfa.”<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonatani abwira Dawidi ati: “Ico ugomba cose ko nkora ndakigukorera.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Nuko Dawidi aramubwira ati: “Raba ejo ni umusi mukuru w’ukwezi gushasha, nategerezwa gusangira n’umwami; ariko reka ngende nihishe mu mirima gushika ku mugoroba wa hirya y’ejo. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />So niyambaza akambura, uze umubwire uti: ‘Dawidi yanyinginze ngo ndamuhe uruhusha rwo gukubitira i Betelehemu mu gisagara c’iwabo, kuko haja gutangirwa ikimazi c’umwaka c’umuryango wose.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Niyavuga ati: ‘Ni vyiza,’ jewe umusavyi wawe nzoba ndi amahoro. Ariko niyashangashirwa, uzoce umenya ko yafashe ingingo yo kungirira nabi. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Ariko wewe, uze wereke imbabazi umusavyi wawe, kuko wanshize mw’isezerano hamwe nawe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ninaba ntsindwa n’urubanza, ube ari wewe unyiyicira! Ni iki cotuma undekurira mu maboko ya so?”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonatani aravuga ati: “Ntibikabe! Mbega iyo mba namenye na gatoya ko data agomba kukugirira nabi, simba nabikubwiye?”<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Dawidi arabaza ati: “Ni nde ari bumenyeshe nimba so akwishuranye ishavu?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonatani aravuga ati: “Nuze, tugende mu murima.” Nuko barajana.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Maze Yonatani abwira Dawidi ati: “Ndakurahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli, hirya y’ejo amasaha ageze nk’aho ageze ubu nzovugana na data! Ninasanga afise imigabo myiza kuri wewe, sinzokurungikira agakuru ngo ndakumenyeshe? <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Ariko ninasanga data afise imigabo mibi yo kukugirira nabi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze abimpanire, kandi birushirije, nintabikumenyesha ngo ndakubwire uhunge. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abane nawe nk’uko yahora abana na data. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Ariko uze unyereke ukugira neza kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igihe cose nzoba nkiriho. Kandi mpfuye, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />uze ugaragaze urukundo ku muryango wanje, mbere n’igihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba amaze abansi bawe bose kw’isi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Nuko Yonatani agirana n’inzu ya Dawidi isezerano, avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze asubirize mu nkoko abansi ba Dawidi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Yonatani yongera kurahiza Dawidi ko azoguma amukunda; kandi mu vy’ukuri Yonatani yaramukunda nk’uko yikunda.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Nuko Yonatani abwira Dawidi ati: “Ejo ni umusi mukuru w’ukwezi gushasha. Uzoboneka ko atari ho uri, kuko icicaro cawe kizoba kigaragara. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Hirya y’ejo, ku muhingamo, uze uje hamwe winyegeza mbere, urindirire i ruhande y’ibuye ry’i Ezeli. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Nzorasa imyampi itatu i ruhande yaho, nk’aho noba ndiko ndarasa ikintu. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Maze nzotuma umukozi wanje mvuge nti: ‘Genda utore irya myampi.’ Ninavuga nti: ‘Ehe, imyampi iri i ruhande yawe; yinzanire,’ uzoce uza, kuko, ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bizoba ari amahoro; nta ngorane izoba ihari. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Ariko ninabwira wa mukozi nti: ‘Imyampi yarenze inyuma yawe,’ uze uce ugenda, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba akwemereye kugenda. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Kandi ku vyo tuvuganye jewe nawe wibuke, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we cabona cacu twempi ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Nuko Dawidi yinyegeza mu murima, maze wa musi mukuru w’ukwezi gushasha ushitse, umwami aricara ngo afungure. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Yicara mu kibanza yari asanzwe yicaramwo giherereye ku gihome, atumberanye na Yonatani, na Abuneri yicaye i ruhande ya Sawuli, ariko ikibanza ca Dawidi caragaragara. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Sawuli nta co yavuze uwo musi, kuko yiyumviriye ati: “Hoba hari icahumanije Dawidi akaba mu vy’ukuri ahumanye.” <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Ariko bukeye, ku musi ugira kabiri w’ukwezi, ikibanza ca Dawidi cari kigaragara kandi. Maze Sawuli abaza umuhungu wiwe Yonatani ati: “Mbega mwene Isayi ko ataje gufungura ejo n’uwu musi?”<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonatani aramwishura ati: “Dawidi yaranyinginze ngo ndamuhe uruhusha rwo kuja i Betelehemu. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Yavuze ati: ‘Reka ngende kuko umuryango wacu uza gutangira ikimazi mu gisagara kandi mukuru wanje yantegetse kuhaba. Ninaba ngiriwe ubuntu mu maso yawe, reka ngende kuraba bakuru banje.’ Ni co gituma atashoboye kuba ku meza hamwe n’umwami.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Sawuli arakira Yonatani cane maze aramubwira ati: “Wa muhungu w’umugore w’ingare n’ingeso mbi! Mbega wibaza ko ntazi yuko ugomba ko mwene Isayi aba umwami mu gishingo cawe, ukaba agatetereza kuri wewe no kuri nyoko yakuvyaye? <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Igihe cose urya muhungu wa Isayi azoba akiriho, yaba wewe canke ubwami bwawe ntibuzorama. Ubu rero tuma umuntu amunzanire, kuko ategerezwa gupfa!”<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonatani abaza se ati: “Kubera iki yokwicwa? Yakoze iki?” <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Nuko Sawuli abangura rya cumu ryiwe ngo arimutere. Yonatani aca amenya ko se yagabiye kwica Dawidi.<verse eid="1SA 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Yonatani aca arivumbura ava ku meza ashavuye cane; kuri uwo musi ugira kabiri w’ukwezi ntiyafunguye, kuko yari ababajwe n’ivyo se agirira Dawidi.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Bukeye mu gitondo Yonatani arasohoka aja mu murima ha hantu bateguye guhurira na Dawidi. Yari kumwe n’umuhungu mutoya, <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />maze abwira uwo muhungu ati: “Iruka untorere imyampi nza kurasa.” Wa muhungu akiriko ariruka kuyitora, arasa umwampi uramurengana. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Wa muhungu ashitse aho wa mwampi waguye, Yonatani arasemerera ati: “Mbega umwampi ntiwarenze?” <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Yongera gusemerera ati: “Nyaruka ningoga! Ntuhagarare!” Wa muhungu atora wa mwampi asubira kwa shebuja. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />(Uwo muhungu ntiyamenye na kimwe muri ivyo; Yonatani na Dawidi ni bo bari bazi ivyo bakora) <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yonatani aca aha vya bigwanisho wa muhungu aramubwira ati: “Genda, ubisubize mu gisagara.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Wa muhungu amaze kugenda, Dawidi aranyeguruka ava mu bumanuko bwa rya buye yunamira Yonatani gatatu, akoza umutwe hasi. Baca baragumbirana bararira ariko Dawidi arira cane.<verse eid="1SA 20:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Yonatani aravuga ati: “Genda amahoro, kuko twasezeranye mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko tuzoba abagenzi, tukavuga tuti: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we cabona hagati yawe nanje, no hagati y’uruvyaro rwawe n’urwanje ibihe vyose.’ ” Nuko Dawidi aragenda, Yonatani na we asubira mu gisagara.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi aja i Nobu kwa Ahimeleki umuherezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Dawidi aja i Nobu, kwa Ahimeleki umuherezi. Ahimeleki amubonye agira ubwoba arajugumira, aca amubaza ati: “Ko uri wenyene? Ni kuki ata n’umwe muri kumwe?”<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Dawidi yishura Ahimeleki umuherezi ati: “Umwami yantumye igikorwa aca ambwira ati: ‘Ntihagire umuntu n’umwe amenya ivyerekeye igikorwa ndagutumye.’ Abantu banje na bo nababwiye aho tuzohurira. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />None ufise iki co kurya? Numpe imikate itanu canke ikindi cose woronka.”<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Ahimeleki yishura Dawidi ati: “Nta mukate usanzwe mfise; ariko, hano hari imikate yejejwe nshobora kuguha, nimba abagabo muri kumwe badaherutse kuryamana n’abagore babo.”<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Dawidi aramwishura ati: “Ntuhagarike umutima ku bw’ivyo. Igihe cose tuba dufise urugamba twama twirinda kuryamana n’abagore. Kandi ko bama bizigama ngo ntibiyanduze mu bihe bisanzwe, mbega ubu ntibarushiriza!” <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Nuko wa muherezi amuha ya mikate ihezagiye, kuko ata yindi yariho, kiretse iyo mikate y’ishikanwa yari yakuwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uwo musi nyene isubirizwa iyindi igishushe.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Ngaho nyene, hariho umusuku wa Sawuli yari yiriwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; yitwa Dowegi Umunyedomu, akaba umukuru w’abungere ba Sawuli.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Dawidi abaza Ahimeleki ati: “Nta cumu woba ufise ngaha canke inkota? Sinazanye inkota yanje canke ikindi kigwanisho na kimwe, kuko ico umwami yari antumye cihutirwa cane.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Wa muherezi arishura ati: “Hari ya nkota ya Goliyati Umufilisitiya, umwe wicira mu kiyaya ca Ela; izingiriye mu mpuzu inyuma ya efodi. Niwaba uyigomba, yakire; kuko nta yindi nkota ihari atari iyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">Dawidi aramwishura ati: “Nta yoza isumba iyo; yimpe!”<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawidi aja i Gati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Kuri uwo musi Dawidi ahunga Sawuli, aja kwa Akishi umwami w’i Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Ariko abasuku ba Akishi baramubwira bati: “Uwu si Dawidi, umwami w’igihugu ca Isirayeli? Uwu si we baririmbiye batamba, bavuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 21:11">‘Sawuli yishe ibihumbi vyiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 21:11">Dawidi we yica ibihumbi incuro icumi’?”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Dawidi yumva ivyo bavuga vyose, aca agira ubwoba bwinshi atinya Akishi umwami w’i Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Nuko aca yihindura nk’umusazi imbere yabo; akiri mu maboko yabo atangura kuvuga ibidahuye, no guharagura inzugi z’irembo no kurekereza inkonda mu bwanwa.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishi abwira abasuku biwe ati: “Raba uwu mugabo! Ni umusazi! Ni kuki mwamunzaniye? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Nari nkenye abasazi aho mumunzanira ngo akore ibintu nk’ivyo imbere yanje? Uwu nokwemera ko yinjira mu nzu yanje?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi aja i Adulamu n’i Misipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Dawidi ava i Gati ahungira mw’isenga ry’i Adulamu. Bakuru biwe n’abo mu nzu ya se bavyumvise, baramanuka bamusangayo. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />N’abandi bantu bahanzwe n’ingorane, uri abaheranye, uri abashegeshwe buzuye umwikomo, baramukurikira, araheza aba umukuru wabo. Abari kumwe na we, barashika hafi amajana ane.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Dawidi avayo aja i Misipehi i Mowabu maze abaza umwami w’i Mowabu ati: “Ndagusavye wemerere data na mama baze babe ngaha iwawe kugeza aho nzomenyera ico Imana izonkorera?” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Nuko, uhereye ico gihe abavyeyi ba Dawidi babana n’umwami w’i Mowabu kandi bagumana na we igihe cose Dawidi yamaze mu kinyegero.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Ariko, uwavugishwa n’Imana Gadi abwira Dawidi ati: “Ntugume winyegeje. Genda mu gihugu c’i Buyuda.” Nuko Dawidi aca ava ngaho aragenda yinjira mw’ishamba ry’i Hereti.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawuli yica umuherezi w’i Nobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Nuko Sawuli amenya ko Dawidi n’abantu biwe hari abababonye aho bari. Sawuli yari yicaye musi y’igiti citwa tamarisi ku musozi w’i Gibeya, n’icumu ryiwe mu minwe, abishikira biwe bose bamukikije. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Sawuli arababwira ati: “Nimunyumvirize yemwe Babenyamini mwese! Mbega mwene Isayi azobaha mwese amatongo n’imizabibu? Mbega azobagira abakuru b’ingabo igihumbi abandi abagire abakuru b’ingabo ijana? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Mbega ni co gituma mwese mwagiye inama yo kungwanya? Nta n’umwe yigeze ambwira igihe umuhungu wanje yagiriraniye amasezerano na wa muhungu wa Isayi. Nta n’umwe ambabaye kuko ata n’umwe yambwiye igihe umuhungu wanje yosha uwo mukozi wanje kuntega imitego nk’uko bimeze uwu musi.”<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Ariko Dowegi Umunyedomu, yari ahagararanye n’abakuru b’ingabo ba Sawuli aca aravuga ati: “Narabonye wa muhungu wa Isayi aza kwa Ahimeleki mwene Ahitubu w’i Nobu. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimeleki yamusigurije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, amuha ivyokurya, yongera amuha na ya nkota ya Goliyati Umufilisitiya.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Nuko umwami atumako umuherezi Ahimeleki mwene Ahitubu n’umuryango wa se wose, bari abaherezi i Nobu, bose baza aho umwami yari ari. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sawuli aravuga ati: “Umviriza rero, yewe mwene Ahitubu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Arishura ati: “Egome nyakwubahwa.”<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sawuli aramubwira ati: “Ni kuki mwangiriye inama wewe na mwene Isayi, ukamuha ivyokurya n’inkota ukanamusiguriza Imana, kugira ngo angararize, antege n’umutego, nk’uko yabikoze uwu musi?”<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimeleki yishura umwami ati: “Mbega mu basavyi bawe bakwumvira ni nde yoba ari umwizigirwa wawe kunganya Dawidi, umukwe w’umwami? Si we mukuru w’ingabo zicungera ubuzima bwawe kandi yubashwe n’abo mu rugo rwawe bose? <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Mbega ugira ngo uwo musi bwari bwo bwa mbere ndamusiguriza Imana? Haba na mba! Mwami, ntiwagirize umusavyi wawe canke n’umwe mu bo mu muryango wanje, kuko umusavyi wawe ata na kimwe nzi muri ivyo vyose.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Ariko umwami aravuga ati: “Ahimeleki, ntugenda udapfuye, wewe n’umuryango wa so wose.”<verse eid="1SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Nuko umwami ategeka abamucungerera ubuzima bari i ruhande yiwe ati: “Hindukira mwice aba baherezi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko na bo nyene bashigikiye Dawidi. Baramenye ko yariko arahunga, ariko ntibabimbwira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:17">Ariko abo bakuru ntibemera kwica abaherezi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="1SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Nuko umwami ategeka Dowegi ati: “Hindukira wewe wice abo baherezi.” Maze Dowegi Umunyedomu arahindukira yica ba baherezi. Kuri uwo musi yishe abagabo mirongo umunani na batanu kandi bacambaye efodi zera. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Amarisha inkota abantu b’i Nobu, igisagara c’abo baherezi, abagabo n’abagore, abana n’inzoya, inka, indogoba n’intama.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Ariko Abiyatari, mwene Ahimeleki, Ahimeleki mwene Ahitubu, arashobora kunyegera ahungira kwa Dawidi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Maze abwira Dawidi ingene Sawuli yishe abaherezi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Nuko Dawidi abwira Abiyatari ati: “Kuri urya musi, igihe wa Munyedomu Dowegi yari harya, nari nzi ko ategerezwa kubibwira Sawuli. Ni jewe ntumye umuryango wa so wose upfa. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Gumana nanje; ntutinye; uwurondera kukwica ni we ariko ararondera kunyica nanje. Uri kumwe nanje uzoba amahoro.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi atabara igisagara c’i Keyila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Umusi umwe inkuru iragenda ishikira Dawidi ko Abafilisitiya bariko baratera i Keyila kandi bariko baranyaga ingano bazikura ku mbuga aho zisekurirwa. <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Dawidi aca asiguza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Ngende gutera abo Bafilisitiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Egome, genda, utere Abafilisitiya utabare Keyila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Ariko abantu ba Dawidi baramubwira bati: “Na hano turi i Buyuda turi n’ubwoba, none twokwubahuka tukaja kugwanira Keyila, tukihanga ingabo zose z’Abafilisitiya?”<verse eid="1SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Dawidi yongera gusiguza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Manuka i Keyila, kuko nzogabura Abafilisitiya mu maboko yawe.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Nuko Dawidi n’abantu biwe baja i Keyila, bagwanya Abafilisitiya babanyaga ibitungwa vyabo vyose. Atsinda Abafilisitiya bahaburira ibintu vyinshi cane kandi yongera akiza abantu baho. <verse eid="1SA 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />(Abiyatari mwene Ahimeleki igihe yahungira iyo Dawidi ari i Keyila, yahunganye efodi.)<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawuli ahiga Dawidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Mu nyuma, babwira Sawuli ko Dawidi yagiye i Keyila, na we aca aravuga ati: “Imana iramugabuye mu maboko yanje, kuko Dawidi yiyugaraniye mw’ibohero mu kwinjira igisagara gifise inzugi n’ibihindizo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Maze Sawuli atumako ingabo ziwe zose ngo baje mu ntambara, ngo bamanuke bose i Keyila bafate Dawidi n’abantu biwe.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Dawidi amenye iyo nteguro ya Sawuli, aca abwira Abiyatari umuherezi ati: “Zana ya efodi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Dawidi aravuga ati: “Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana y’Abisirayeli, umusavyi wawe numvise ko Sawuli yateguye kuza i Keyila gusambura igisagara kubera jewe. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Mbega abantu b’i Keyila bazontanga mu maboko yiwe? Mbega Sawuli azomanuka, nk’uko navyumvise? Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana y’Abisirayeli, mbwira jewe umusavyi wawe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Azomanuka.”<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Dawidi yongera kubaza ati: “Mbega abantu b’i Keyila bazontanga mu maboko ya Sawuli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Bazogutanga.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Nuko Dawidi n’abantu bari kumwe na we, bakaba bari nk’amajana atandatu, bava i Keyila bagenda bacumbika mu bibanza bitandukanye. Sawuli amaze kubwirwa ko Dawidi yahunze akava i Keyila, ntiyaba akijayo.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Dawidi aguma yinyegeje mu bugaragwa no mu misozi yo mu bugaragwa bw’i Zifu, Sawuli akaguma amuhiga umusi ku wundi, ariko Imana ntiyagabura Dawidi mu maboko yiwe.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Igihe Dawidi yari i Horeshi mu bugaragwa bw’i Zifu, yumva ko Sawuli aje kumwica. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Maze Yonatani mwene Sawuli aja kwa Dawidi i Horeshi ajanywe no kumuremesha ngo akomere mu kwizera Imana. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Aramubwira ati: “Ntutinye. Data Sawuli ntazogukorako. Uzoba umwami w’Abisirayeli, nanje nzoba icegera cawe. Kandi na data Sawuli arabizi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Bompi bagira isezerano imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Maze Yonatani arataha, ariko Dawidi aguma i Horeshi.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Abantu b’i Zifu baraduga kwa Sawuli i Gibeya bamubwira bati: “Mbega Dawidi ntiyinyegeje i Horeshi, ku musozi w’i Hakila, mu bumanuko bwa Yeshimoni? <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />None rero, mwami, manuka igihe cose uzobishakira, natwe tuzomutanga mu maboko yawe.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sawuli arabishura ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abahezagire kuko mumbabaye. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Genda mutohoze neza. Mumenye aho Dawidi akunda kuja, n’umuntu yoba yaramubonyeyo. Kuko ndazi ko ari umunyabwenge. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Mumenye aho akunda kubunda hanyuma muze mumpe inkuru y’imvaho. Maze nzojana namwe; niyaba ari muri ako karere, nzomuhiga hose no mu nzu zose zo mu muryango wa Yuda.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Nuko barasohoka bitangira imbere ya Sawuli. Dawidi n’abantu biwe bari mu bugaragwa bw’i Mayoni, muri Araba mu bumanuko bwa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sawuli n’abantu biwe batangura kubaririkiza, maze babibwiye Dawidi, aca amanuka ku gitandara aguma mu bugaragwa bw’i Mayoni. Sawuli avyumvise, aja mu bugaragwa bw’i Mayoni ahiga Dawidi.<verse eid="1SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sawuli yariko aca mu mbavu z’umusozi, Dawidi na we n’abantu biwe bari ku rundi ruhande, bihuta ngo basige Sawuli. Kandi Sawuli n’ingabo zari kumwe na we begereje gufata Dawidi n’abari kumwe na we, <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />intumwa iza kuri Sawuli imubwira iti: “Nimunyaruke ningoga! Abafilisitiya barateye igihugu.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Maze Sawuli aca areka gukurikira Dawidi aja kugwanya Abafilisitiya. Ni co catumye aho hantu hitwa Sela Hamahilekoti risigura “igitandara co gutandukana”. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Nuko Dawidi aca araduga ava aho aja kwinyegeza i Eni-Gedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi yanka kwica Sawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Sawuli avuye kugwanya Abafilisitiya, bamubwira bati: “Dawidi ari mu bugaragwa bw’i Eni-Gedi.” <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Nuko atoranya abasoda b’indobanurwa ibihumbi bitatu bavuye mu Bisirayeli baja kurondera Dawidi n’abantu biwe i ruhande y’ibitandara vy’impene z’inyeshamba.<verse eid="1SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Ashitse ku mpongore z’intama zari i ruhande y’inzira; hari isenga, Sawuli aja kwihagarika muri ryo. Kandi Dawidi n’abantu biwe bari muri ryo imbere. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Ba bantu baravuga bati: “Uwu ni wa musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuga, igihe yakubwira ngo: ‘Nzogabura umwansi wawe mu maboko yawe ngo umugenze uko ushaka.’ ” Nuko Dawidi arasoboka aca ipfundo ry’ikanzu ya Sawuli.<verse eid="1SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Hanyuma Dawidi yumva umutima umurega kuko yacacuye ipfundo ry’ikanzu yiwe. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Abwira abantu biwe ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> andinde gukora ikintu nk’ico kuri databuja, uwo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yimikishije amavuta, canke ngo ndamuramvurireko ukuboko; kuko ari uwasizwe amavuta n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Avuze ivyo aca abuza abantu biwe kugirira nabi Sawuli. Maze Sawuli ava muri rya senga aragenda.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Maze Dawidi arasohoka ava muri rya senga ahamagara Sawuli ati: “Nyakwubahwa mwami wanje!” Sawuli akebutse, Dawidi arunama ashikana umutwe hasi. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Abwira Sawuli ati: “Ni kuki wumva ivyo abantu bakubwira ngo: ‘Dawidi arondera kukugirira nabi’? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Ubwawe uriboneye uwu musi ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yakugabuye mu maboko yanje muri rirya senga. Hari abampanuye kukwica, ariko nakwirekeye; navuze nti: ‘sinzobangurira ukuboko databuja, kuko yasizwe amavuta n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Raba, muvyeyi wanje, ehe iri pfundo ry’ikanzu yawe mu kuboko kwanje! Nacacuye ipfundo ry’impuzu yawe ariko sinakwishe. Ubu rero tahura kandi umenye ko ata kimenyetso c’uko noba narakugiriye nabi canke nkakugarariza. Nta kibi nagukoreye, ariko uriko urampiga ngo unyice. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> naducire urubanza. Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ampore ku bibi vyose wankoreye, ariko jewe sinzogukozako ukuboko kwanje. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Nk’uko baca umugani ngo: ‘Mu munyakibi havamwo ibikorwa bibi,’ ni co gituma ntazogukozako ukuboko kwanje.<verse eid="1SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Mbega umwami w’Abisirayeli yasohotse guhiga nde? Uriko urakurikira nde? Imbwa ipfuye? Imbaragasa? <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> naducire urubanza. Arabe iconkiza akinkorere; amburanire mu kunkura mu kuboko kwawe.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Dawidi ahejeje kuvuga ivyo Sawuli arabaza ati: “Ni wewe, ga mwana wanje Dawidi?” Araboroga cane. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Aravuga ati: “Urandushije kugororoka. Wangiriye neza, jewe nakugiriye nabi. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Uhejeje kumbwira ivyiza wankoreye; <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yangabuye mu maboko yawe, ariko ntiwanyishe. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Mbega umuntu afashe umwansi wiwe yomurekura atamugiriye nabi? <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aguhembere ivyo ungiriye uwu musi. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Ndazi ko utazogenda utabaye umwami kandi ko ubwami bw’Abisirayeli buzokomezwa n’amaboko yawe. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Ubu rero ndahira mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko utazohonya uruvyaro rwanje canke ngo ufute izina ryanje mu muryango wa data.”<verse eid="1SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Nuko Dawidi arahira Sawuli. Maze Sawuli asubira iwe, ariko Dawidi n’abantu biwe baduga kwinyegeza mu misozi.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Ivya Dawidi, Nabali na Abigayili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Muri ico gihe Samweli arapfa, maze Abisirayeli bose bakoranira hamwe baramuririra; bamuhamba i muhira iwe i Rama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Hanyuma Dawidi aramanuka aja mu bugaragwa bw’i Parani.<verse eid="1SA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Umuntu umwe w’i Mayoni, yari afise itongo ngaho i Karumeli, yari atunze cane. Yari afise impene igihumbi n’intama ibihumbi bitatu, akaba yama azimwera ubwoya i Karumeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Uwo mugabo yitwa Nabali, umugore wiwe na we akitwa Abigayili. Uwo mugore yari umunyabwenge kandi akaba mwiza cane, ariko umugabo wiwe, yakomoka mu muryango wa Kalebu, yari umuntu agoye kandi w’ingeso mbi.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Dawidi akiri mu bugaragwa, yumva ko Nabali ariko aramwa intama ubwoya. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Nuko arungika abasore cumi arababwira ati: “Nimugende kwa Nabali i Karumeli mumundamukirize. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Mumubwire muti: ‘Urakaramba! Ugire amagara meza n’ivyo utunze vyose n’abawe bose! Amagara meza abe ku kintu cose citwa icawe!<verse eid="1SA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Numvise ko ari igihe co kumwa intama zawe. None rero, abungere bawe bari kumwe natwe, ntitwigeze tubagirira nabi, kandi igihe cose bamaze i Karumeli nta kintu na kimwe mu vyabo cazimiye. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Baza n’abakozi bawe barabikubwira. Nuko rero ugirire neza aba bantu banje, kuko tuje ari ku musi mukuru. Ndakwinginze nuhe abasavyi bawe n’umuhungu wawe Dawidi ico ushobora kubaronkera cose.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Ba bantu ba Dawidi bashitse, bashikiriza Nabali bwa butumwa bwa Dawidi, baca bararindira.<verse eid="1SA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Nabali yishura ba basore ba Dawidi ati: “Uwo Dawidi ni nde? Mwene Isayi ni nde? Muri iyi misi hari abakozi benshi bahunga ba shebuja. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Ni kuki nofata indya zanje n’amazi yanje, n’inyama nabagiye abariko baramwa intama, ngo ndabihe abantu ntazi iyo bavuye?”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Ba bantu ba Dawidi barahindukira basubira inyuma. Bashitse, bamushikiriza ivyo babwiwe vyose. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Dawidi abwira abantu biwe ati: “Nimwambare inkota zanyu!” Nuko bambara inkota zabo, na Dawidi na we nyene yambara iyiwe. Abagabo bashika nk’amajana ane badugana na Dawidi, amajana abiri na bo basigara barinze ibintu.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Umwe mu bakozi abwira Abigayili muka Nabali ati: “Dawidi yarungitse intumwa ziva mu bugaragwa zizaniye indamukanyo databuja, ariko yabakiriye nabi arabatuka. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Kandi abo bantu batugiriye neza cane, nta kibi na kimwe bigeze batugirira, kandi igihe cose twari mu misozi hafi y’aho bari nta na kimwe cabuze. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Mw’ijoro no ku murango bari nk’uruzitiro rudukikije igihe cose twari turagiye intama hafi yabo. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />None rero nuvyiyumvire ugire ico ukoze, kuko ivyago bihanamiye databuja n’abo mu rugo rwiwe rwose. Ni umuntu mubi ku buryo ata muntu yomuvugisha.”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigayili ntiyatevye. Afata imikate amajana abiri, imikuza ibiri y’umuvinyu, intama zitanu zateguwe neza, ingero seya zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 27.</char></note> z’ingano zikaranze, n’amahando y’inzabibu zumye ijana n’udukate dukozwe mu nsukoni ziseye, abikorera indogoba. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Maze abwira abakozi biwe ati: “Nimunyitangire imbere; nanje ndaza inyuma yanyu.” Ariko ntiyabwira umugabo wiwe Nabali.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Maze aragenda ari ku ndogoba yiwe ku mpinga y’umusozi, Dawidi n’abantu biwe bariko baramanuka batumbereye iyo ari, hanyuma barahura. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Dawidi yari yavuze ati: “Nta co vyamaze kuba narinze neza ibintu vy’uwu mugabo mu bugaragwa kugira ngo ntihagire ikibura. Anyishuye ibibi ku vyiza namukoreye. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Imana ize ibimpanire, mbere birushirije, nihashika mu gitondo hagisigaye izina muhungu mu bantu biwe!”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigayili abonye Dawidi, yururuka ningoga ava ku ndogoba yiwe yunama imbere ya Dawidi, yubamye hasi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Yubama imbere y’ibirenge vyiwe avuga ati: “Nyakwubahwa, amakosa yose naje kuri jewe. Ndakwinginze, unyemerere umusavyikazi wawe mvugane nawe; Niwumvirize ivyo umusavyikazi wawe ngira mvuge. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Icompa umwami wanje ntashire umutima ku vyo urya muntu mubi Nabali yavuze. Izina ni ryo muntu, izina ryiwe ni igipfu, kandi ubupfu bujana na we. Ariko jeho, umusavyikazi wawe, sinabonye abantu databuja yari yarungitse.”<verse eid="1SA 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />“None rero nyakwubahwa, ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakurinze ngo ntuvishe amaraso kandi ntiwihore n’amaboko yawe, ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ukubaho kwawe nyene, icompa abansi bawe n’abagomba kukugirira nabi bakaba nka Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Kandi iri shikanwa, umusavyikazi wawe nzaniye databuja, rihabwe aba bantu bari inyuma yawe.<verse eid="1SA 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Harira icaha c’umusavyikazi wawe, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoshimangira ubwami bwa databuja, kuko ugwana intambara z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ntihabe igikorwa kibi kiboneka kuri wewe igihe cose ukiriho. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Naho hari umuntu aguhiga ngo akwice, ubuzima bwa databuja buzozigamirwa mw’isi y’abazima n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe. Ariko ubuzima bw’abansi bawe buzoshiburirwa kure nk’ibuye ritewe n’umugozi. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Igihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba yakugiriye vya vyiza vyose yagusezeranira kandi niyaba yakugize umurongozi w’Abisirayeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />ntuze ugire ikikwagiriza mu mutima ko wishe umuntu bidakenewe canke ko wihoye. Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> niyakugirira neza, nyakwubahwa, uze wibuke umusavyikazi wawe.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Dawidi abwira Abigayili ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli ahimbazwe, yakurungitse uwu musi guhura nanje. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Uragahezagirwa kuko wiyumviriye neza ukaza kuntangira ngo simvishe amaraso uwu musi kandi ngo sinihore n’amaboko yanje ubwanje. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Iyo bitaba uko, ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’Abisirayeli, yandinze ngo sindabagirire nabi, iyo utaba waje wihuta aho ndi, nta zina muhungu mu ba Nabali yari gusigara akiriho ejo mu mutwenzi.”<verse eid="1SA 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Maze Dawidi yakira ivyo wa mugore yari azanye vyose aca amubwira ati: “Genda amahoro. Numvise amajambo yawe kandi nkoze ivyo wasavye.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigayili agiye kwa Nabali, asanga ari mu nzu yateguye amazimano nk’ay’umwami. Yari yaborewe cane atakimenya ico avuga. Nuko ntiyagira ico amubarira gushika bukeye. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Maze mu gitondo, Nabali inzoga zamuvuyeko, umugore wiwe amubwira ivyaraye bibaye, aca agwa igihumura umutima wiwe umera nk’ibuye. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Haciye nk’imisi cumi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akubita Nabali arapfa.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Dawidi yumvise ko Nabali yapfuye, aravuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahimbazwe, yangwaniye kwa Nabali kuko yari yankengereye. Yarinze umusavyi wayo gukora ikibi maze isubiza ibibi Nabali yakoze ku mutwe wiwe ubwiwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Maze Dawidi atuma intumwa kuri Abigayili, amusaba ko yomubera umugore. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Abakozi biwe bagenda i Karumeli babwira Abigayili bati: “Dawidi yadutumye ngo tukujane umubere umugore.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Maze arunama ashikana umutwe hasi, avuga ati: “Umusavyikazi wawe ndi hano, niteguriye kugukorera no kwoza ibirenge vy’abakozi ba databuja.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigayili ava hasi ningoga yurira indogoba, aherekejwe n’abaguranokazi biwe batanu, bajana na za ntumwa za Dawidi aca aba umugore wiwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Dawidi yari yararongoye na Ahinowamu w’i Yezireyeli, bompi bari abagore biwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Ariko Sawuli yari yaramaze guha umukobwa wiwe Mikali muka Dawidi, umugabo yitwa Palutiyeli mwene Layishi yava i Galimu.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi asubira kwanka kwica Sawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Abantu b’i Zifu bagenda kwa Sawuli i Gibeya bamubwira bati: “Mbega Dawidi ntiyinyegeje ku musozi w’i Hakila, uhereranye n’i Yeshimoni?”<verse eid="1SA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Nuko Sawuli aramanuka aja mu bugaragwa bw’i Zifu, ari kumwe n’ingabo ibihumbi bitatu vy’abahizi b’indobanurwa mu Bisirayeli, agiye guhiga Dawidi. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sawuli ashinga amahema y’ikambi yiwe i ruhande y’inzira iri ku musozi w’i Hakila hahereranye n’i Yeshimoni, ariko Dawidi aguma mu bugaragwa. Yumvise ko Sawuli yamukurikiyeyo, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />aca arungika abantu kugendereza, kugira ngo amenye ko Sawuli yashitse vy’ukuri.<verse eid="1SA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Nuko Dawidi arasoboka aja hamwe Sawuli yari acumbitse. Abona aho Sawuli na Abuneri mwene Neri, umukuru w’ingabo bari, baryamye. Sawuli yari aryamye hagati muri iyo kambi, ingabo zose zimukikije.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Nuko Dawidi abaza Ahimeleki Umuheti na Abishayi mwene Zeruwiya, murumuna wa Yowabu ati: “Ni nde yemera kumanukana nanje aho Sawuli ari mw’ikambi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Abishayi aramwishura ati: “Jewe turajana.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Nuko Dawidi na Abishayi bagenda aho za ngabo ziri mw’ijoro, babona Sawuli, aryamye asinziriye hagati y’ingabo n’icumu ryiwe rishinze hasi hafi y’umutwe wiwe. Abuneri n’izindi ngabo bari bamukikije.<verse eid="1SA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abishayi abwira Dawidi ati: “Uyu musi Imana igabuye umwansi wawe mu maboko yawe. Nyemerera rero ndamucumite rimwe gusa icumu ryanje rice rimufatanya n’isi; sincumita kabiri.”<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Ariko Dawidi abwira Abishayi ati: “Oya, ntumwice! Ni nde yoramvurira ukuboko ku wo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarobanuje amavuta, ntabeko icaha? <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ubwiwe ni we azomwiyicira; canke na ho umusi wiwe uzoshika apfe, canke azoja mu ntambara agweyo. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> andinde gukoza ukuboko ku muntu yarobanuje amavuta. Ubu genda utore rirya cumu n’umukuza w’amazi biri ku mutwe wiwe, tugende.”<verse eid="1SA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Nuko Dawidi atwara rya cumu na wa mukuza w’amazi vyari ku mutwe wa Sawuli, baca barigira. Bose bari basinziriye, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabasinzirije ubutikoma.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Maze Dawidi arajabuka aja hakurya ahagarara ku gatwe k’umusozi uri hirya y’aho bacumbitse; mugabo atari hafi. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Ahamagara ingabo na Abuneri mwene Neri ati: “Mbega Abuneri, ko utanyishura?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Abuneri arishura ati: “Uri nde uvyura umwami?”<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Dawidi aramwishura ati: “Wewe nzi ko uri umugabo, si ko none? Kandi ni nde muri Isirayeli ahambaye nkawe? None ni iki catumye udateramira shobuja umwami igihe umuntu yaza kumwica. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Ivyo wakoze si vyiza. Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wewe n’ingabo muri kumwe mukwiye gupfa, kuko mutateramiye shobuja, uwo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yimikishije amavuta. Raba hose! Icumu n’umukuza w’amazi vy’umwami vyari i ruhande y’umutwe wiwe biri hehe?”<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Sawuli amenya ijwi rya Dawidi aravuga ati: “Ni wewe ga mwana wanje Dawidi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Dawidi aramwishura ati: “Egome ni jewe databuja, mwami.” <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Arongerako ati: “Ni kuki databuja umwami ahiga jewe umusavyi wiwe? Ni igiki nakoze kibi, nagirizwa iki? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />None rero niwumvirize amajambo y’umusavyi wawe. Nimba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we yakundekuriyeko, niyemere ndamuhe ikimazi. Ariko nibaba ari abantu, nibavumwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>! Kuko bankuye mu mugabane wanje mu vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaturaze bakavuga ngo: ‘Genda ukorere izindi mana.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Nuko ntureke ngo amaraso yanje asesekere kure y’inyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Umwami w’Abisirayeli yasohokanywe no guhiga jewe imbaragasa nk’uko umuntu ahiga inkware mu misozi?”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Maze Sawuli aravuga ati: “Nacumuye. Garuka, Dawidi mwana wanje. Kuko wahaye agaciro ubuzima bwanje uwu musi, sinzosubira kurondera kukugirira nabi. Ni ivy’ukuri, nakoze nk’igipfu, kandi nihenze cane.”<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Dawidi aramwishura ati: “Ng’iri icumu ry’umwami. Tuma umwe mu basore bawe aze kuritora. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agerera umuntu wese ibihwanye n’ubugororotsi bwiwe n’ubwizigirwa bwiwe. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakugabuye mu maboko yanje uwu musi, ariko sinokoza ukuboko ku wo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarobanuje amavuta. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Nk’uko nahaye ubuzima bwawe agaciro, abe ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aha agaciro ubuzima bwanje ankize amagorwa yose.”<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Nuko Sawuli abwira Dawidi ati: “Uragahezagirwa, mwana wanje Dawidi; uzokora ibihambaye kandi ni ukuri uzonesha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Nuko Dawidi arigira, Sawuli na we asubira iwe.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi aja mu Bafilisitiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Maze Dawidi ariyumvira ati: “Umusi umwe Sawuli azomfata. Icoba ciza ni uko nohungira mu Bafilisitiya. Maze Sawuli azoca aheba kundonderera ahantu na hamwe muri Isirayeli, nanje nzoca ndamukira.”<verse eid="1SA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Nuko Dawidi na ba bantu amajana atandatu bari kumwe na we baja kwa Akishi mwene Mayoshi, umwami w’i Gati. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Dawidi n’abantu biwe baba i Gati hamwe na Akishi. Umugabo wese yari kumwe n’umuryango wiwe, na Dawidi yari kumwe n’abagore biwe babiri: Ahinowamu w’i Yezireyeli na Abigayili w’i Karumeli yahora ari umugore wa Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sawuli amaze kumenya ko Dawidi yahungiye i Gati, ntiyongera kumuhiga.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Nuko Dawidi abwira Akishi ati: “Ninaba ngiriwe ubuntu mu maso yawe, ndasavye ugire aho umpaye mu bisagara vyo mu gihugu cawe, kugira ngo mbeyo. Mbega ni kuki umusavyi wawe nobana nawe mu gisagara c’ubwami?”<verse eid="1SA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Nuko kuri uwo musi Akishi amuha Zikulagi, kandi aho haciye hegukira abami b’i Buyuda kuva ico gihe kugeza n’ubu. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Dawidi amara umwaka n’amezi ane mu gihugu c’Abafilisitiya.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Nuko Dawidi n’abantu biwe bava ngaho baja kugwanya Abageshuri, Abagiruzi n’Abamaleki. (Kuva kera abo bantu baba hafi y’i Shuri, hegereye ku rubibe rwa Egiputa.) <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Igihe cose Dawidi yatera ahantu, nta muntu n’umwe yasiga ari muzima, yaba umugabo canke umugore, ariko yaca atwara intama n’inka, indogoba n’ingamiya, n’impuzu. Maze agaca asubira kwa Akishi.<verse eid="1SA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Maze Akishi abajije ati: “Mwagiye gutera hehe uwu musi?” Dawidi yaca avuga ati: “Twateye i Negebu h’i Buyuda” canke ati: “Twateye i Negebu h’i Yerahimeyeli” canke ati: “Twateye i Negebu h’Abakayini.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Ntiyasigaza umugore canke umugabo yozana ari muzima i Gati, kuko yibaza ati: “Bohava batanga inkuru kuri twebwe bakavuga bati: ‘Ibi ni vyo Dawidi yakoze.’ ” Uko ni ko yakora igihe cose yabaye mu gihugu c’i Bufilisitiya. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Nuko Akishi yizigira Dawidi, yibwira ati: “Yarigize uwo kwankwa urunuka n’abo mu gihugu ciwe b’Abisirayeli, rero azoba umushumba wanje ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Muri iyo misi Abafilisitiya bakoranya ingabo zabo kugira ngo baje kugwanya Abisirayeli. Akishi abwira Dawidi ati: “Wewe n’iyo misore yawe muzojana nanje ku rugamba.”<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Dawidi aramwishura ati: “Ni ho uzokwibonera ubwawe ivyo umusavyi wawe nshobora gukora.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Akishi aramwishura ati: “Ni vyiza, kandi nanje nzokugira uwuncungerera ubuzima.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawuli n’umupfumu w’i Eni-Dori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Ico gihe Samweli yari yarapfuye, Abisirayeli bose bari baramugandariye, bamuhamba mu gisagara c’iwabo i Rama. Kandi Sawuli yari yarirukanye mu gihugu abapfumu n’abahamagara imizimu bose.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Abafilisitiya barakorana baragenda bashinga ikambi yabo i Shunemu, ico gihe Sawuli na we akoranya Abisirayeli bose bashinga ikambi yabo i Gilibowa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Sawuli abonye ingabo z’Abafilisitiya, aratinya; ubwoba bwuzura umutima wiwe. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Asiguza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyamwishura haba mu nzozi, haba mu buryo bwa Urimu canke aciye mu bavugishwa. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Sawuli abwira abakozi biwe ati: “Nimundonderere umugore ahamagara imizimu, kugira ngo ngende kumusiguza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Baramubarira bati: “Hariho umwe ari i Eni-Dori.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Maze Sawuli ariyoberanya, yambara izindi mpuzu, mw’ijoro ajana n’abantu babiri kwa wa mugore. Aramubwira ati: “Nsiguriza imizimu, umpamagarire uw’uwo nja kukubwira.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Ariko wa mugore amubwira ati: “Ni ukuri urazi neza ivyo Sawuli yakoze n’ingene yakuyeho abahamagara imizimu n’abapfumu mu gihugu. Ni kuki ugomba kuntega umutego ngo uncishe agatwe?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Sawuli aramurahira mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Ndakurahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ko ivyo utazobihanirwa.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Maze wa mugore aramubaza ati: “Ndaguhamagarire nde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Aramubwira ati: “Mpamagarira Samweli.”<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Wa mugore abonye Samweli, araboroga cane, abwira Sawuli ati: “Ni kuki wampenze? Uri Sawuli!”<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Umwami aramubwira ati: “Ntutinye. Ubonye iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Wa mugore aravuga ati: “Mbonye igisa n’umuzimu kiduga kiva mu kuzimu.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Aramubaza ati: “Gisa gute?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Aramwishura ati: “Umutama yambaye ikanzu ni we aduze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Nuko Sawuli amenya ko ari Samweli, aca aramwunamira, akubita ibipfukamiro akoza umutwe hasi.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samweli abwira Sawuli ati: “Ni kuki uriko urangora umpamagara ngo ngaruke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Aravuga ati: “Ni uko ndi mu mubabaro mwinshi. Abafilisitiya baranteye, kandi Imana yarampevye. Ntikinyishura, haba biciye mu bavugishwa canke mu nzozi. Ni co gituma naguhamagaye ngo umbwire ico nkwiye gukora.”<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samweli aramubwira ati: “Ni iki gitumye unsiguza, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaraguhevye akaba umwansi wawe? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akoze ivyo yari yaravuze aciye kuri jewe. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agushikuye ubwami mu maboko yawe kandi buhawe uwo muhanganye ari we Dawidi. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agukoreye ivyo uwu musi, kuko utumviye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> canke ngo ushitse uburake bwiwe bwose ku Bamaleki. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arakugabuye wewe n’Abisirayeli bose mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya, kandi ejo wewe n’abahungu bawe muzoba muri kumwe nanje. Kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azogabura ingabo z’Abisirayeli mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Ubwo nyene Sawuli aca agwa hasi yubamye, yuzuye ubwoba kubera amajambo ya Samweli. Inkomezi zirahera, kuko ata co yari yariye uwo musi wose n’ijoro ryose.<verse eid="1SA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Wa mugore aje aho Sawuli ari, akabona ko yagize ubwoba bwinshi, aramubwira ati: “Raba, umusavyikazi wawe nakwumviye. Nahevye amagara yanje nkora ivyo wantegetse. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />None rero umviriza ivyo umusavyikazi wawe mvuga kandi unyemerere ndakuzanire imfungurwa kugira ngo urye, usubizwemwo intege ushobore gutaha.”<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Aranka aravuga ati: “Sindya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:23">Ariko abantu bari kumwe na we bafatanya n’uwo mugore baramwinginga, maze arabumvira. Ava hasi yicara ku buriri.<verse eid="1SA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Wa mugore arihuta afata ishuri ivyibushe, arayibaga ubwo nyene. Afata ifu, arayicumba akoramwo udukate twokeje twacumbanywe amavuta, tutarimwo umwambiro. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Nuko abishira imbere ya Sawuli n’abantu biwe, bararya. Muri iryo joro nyene bava hasi baragenda.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Akishi asubiza Dawidi i Zikulagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Abafilisitiya bakoranya ingabo zabo zose i Afeki, Abisirayeli na bo bacumbika ku mugezi w’i Yezireyeli. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Maze abakuru b’ingabo z’Abafilisitiya barongoye imice y’amajana n’ibihumbi, hamwe na Dawidi n’abantu biwe bagendera inyuma bari kumwe na Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Abakuru b’ingabo barabaza bati: “Ivy’aba Baheburayo bimeze gute?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Akishi arabishura ati: “Uwu si Dawidi yahora ari umwe mu bakuru b’ingabo kwa Sawuli umwami w’Abisirayeli? Amaze umwaka urenga ari kumwe nanje, kandi kuva ava kwa Sawuli gushika uwu musi nta co ndamugaya.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Ariko ba bakuru b’Abafilisitiya baramushavurira baramubwira bati: “Subiza uwo mugabo inyuma, asubire mu kibanza yagenewe. Ntashobora kujana natwe mu ntambara, yohava aduhindukirira, akatugwanya. Hari ubundi buryo yokwiyuzuza na shebuja atari uguca imitwe izi ngabo zacu? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Uwo si Dawidi umwe bavyinira batamba ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">‘Sawuli yishe ibihumbi vyiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">ariko Dawidi we yishe ibihumbi vyiwe incuro cumi’?”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Maze Akishi ahamagara Dawidi aramubwira ati: “Ndakurahiye uguhoraho kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, wabaye umwizigirwa, kandi vyari bimpimbaye ko ujana nanje mu rugamba. Kuva ku musi waziye iwanje gushika uwu musi, nta kibi nakubonyeko, ariko abatware ntibakwemera. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Isubirire inyuma mu mahoro; ntihagire ico ukora coshavuza abakuru b’Abafilisitiya.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Dawidi aramubaza ati: “Nakoze iki? Ni igiki wabonye wokwagiriza umusavyi wawe kuva ku musi naziyeko iwawe gushika ubu? Ni iki combuza kuja kugwanya abansi ba databuja umwami?”<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akishi aramwishura ati: “Ndazi ko wamye unezera nka marayika w’Imana; ariko abakuru b’ingabo bavuze bati: ‘Ntajane natwe ku rugamba.’ <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Nuko uze uvyuke kare, hamwe n’ingabo zawe mwazananye, mugende hakiri kare.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Nuko Dawidi n’abantu biwe bavyuka kare mu gitondo basubira mu gihugu c’Abafilisitiya, Abafilisitiya na bo baraduga baja i Yezireyeli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Dawidi anesha Abamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Dawidi n’ingabo ziwe bashika i Zikulagi ku musi ugira gatatu. Kandi Abamaleki bari bateye i Negebu n’i Zikulagi; i Zikulagi barahaturira, <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />batwara nk’inyagano abagore n’abandi bantu bose bari kumwe na bo, abato n’abakuze. Ntibishe n’umwe, ariko babajanye bose iyo bariko baraja.<verse eid="1SA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Dawidi n’abo bari kumwe bashika i Zikulagi, basanga hatongowe n’umuriro, abagore, abana babo b’abahungu n’abakobwa bajanywe nk’inyagano. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Nuko Dawidi n’abo bari kumwe bararira cane gushika aho batakironka n’inkomezi zo kurira. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Abagore ba Dawidi babiri, Ahinowamu w’i Yezireyeli na Abigayili umupfakazi wa Nabali w’i Karumeli, na bo nyene bari mu batwawe. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Dawidi aja mu kaga gakomeye, kuko abantu bari bababajwe cane no kubura abahungu babo n’abakobwa babo, hanyuma batangura kuvugana ko bomwicisha amabuye. Ariko Dawidi aremeshwa n’inkomezi ziva k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Maze Dawidi abwira Abiyatari umuherezi, mwene Ahimeleki ati: “Nzanira efodi.” Abiyatari arayimuzanira, <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />maze Dawidi asiguza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Nkurikire aba baduteye? Mbega noba nkibahamvya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Bakurikire. Kandi uraza kubahamvya ugarure n’ivyo banyaze vyose.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Dawidi na ba bantu amajana atandatu bari kumwe na we baragenda bashika ku ruzi rw’i Besori, bamwe basigaraho, <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />kuko abashika amajana abiri bari barushe cane bibananira kujabuka urwo ruzi. Ariko Dawidi n’abandi amajana ane babandanya babakurikira.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Babonye Umunyegiputa mu mirima bamuzanira Dawidi. Bamuha amazi yo kunywa n’ivyokurya <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />igice c’umukate ukozwe mu nsukoni n’udukate tubiri ducumvye mu nzabibu. Ararya asubiramwo intege, kuko yari amaze imisi itatu n’amajoro atatu ata co arya canke anywa.<verse eid="1SA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Dawidi aramubaza ati: “Uri uwo kwa nde, kandi uva hehe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Aramwishura ati: “Ndi Umunyegiputa, umugurano w’Abamaleki. Databuja yantaye ngaha kubera ngwaye haciye imisi itatu. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Twateye i Negebu h’Abakereti no mu ntara ya Yuda n’i Negebu kwa Kalebu, duturira n’i Zikulagi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Dawidi aramubaza ati: “Woshobora kunjana aho abo bateye bari?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Aramwishura ati: “Ndahira imbere y’Imana ko utanyica canke ngo untange mu maboko ya databuja, nca ndakumanukana iyo bari.”<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Nuko amanukana Dawidi, asanga basanzaye ku misozi y’ico gihugu, bariko bararya banywa, bagira umusi mukuru kubera ibintu vyinshi banyaze mu gihugu c’Abafilisitiya n’i Buyuda. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Dawidi n’abantu biwe barabahwikira, babinjiramwo barabagwanya kuva iryo joro ryose kugeza ku mugoroba w’umusi ukurikira, arabanesha kandi nta n’umwe yashoboye gucika ngo ahunge, atari abasore amajana ane basimbiye ku ngamiya bariruka barahunga. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Dawidi agarura ivyo Abamaleki bari banyaze vyose, harimwo na ba bagore biwe babiri. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Nta na kimwe cari kibuzemwo: abakiri bato n’abakuze, abahungu n’abakobwa, n’ivyanyazwe vyose vyari bikwiye. Dawidi arabigarukana vyose. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Ajana amasho n’imikuku, maze abantu biwe babishira imbere y’ibindi bitungwa bagenda bavuga bati: “Ibi ni ivyo Dawidi yanyaze.”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Nuko Dawidi ashikira ba bandi amajana abiri bari barushe basigaye inyuma mu Kiyaya ca Besori. Baza gusanganira Dawidi n’abari kumwe na we bose, Dawidi na we arabaramutsa anezerewe, ababaza ingene bamerewe. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Ariko abantu babi n’abansi b’amahoro bari mu bajanye na Dawidi baravuga bati: “Ko batajanye natwe ku rugamba, ntitwemera kugabura na bo ivyo twanyaze. Ariko umuntu wese ahitane umugore wiwe n’abana biwe ace agenda.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Dawidi arabishura ati: “Oyaye, bavukanyi, ntimukore uko ku vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaduhaye. Yaturinze yongera agabura mu maboko abari baje kudutera. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Ni nde yobashigikira muvuze ibintu nk’ivyo? Umugabane w’uwasigaranye ibintu ni umwe n’uw’uwagiye ku rugamba. Imigabane yabo irangana.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Maze Dawidi abigira itegeko mu Bisirayeli kuva uwo musi gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Dawidi ashitse i Zikulagi, arungikira abakuru b’i Buyuda, bari basanzwe ari abagenzi biwe, ababwira ati: “Iyi ni ingabire ivuye mu vyo twanyaze abansi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="1SA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Arungikira n’ab’i Beteli, Rama Negebu n’i Yatiri; <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />abo muri Aroweri, Sifumoti, Eshitemowa <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />n’i Rakali; abo mu bisagara vy’Abayerahimeyeli n’Abakayini; <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />ab’i Horuma, n’i Bori Ashani, Ataki <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />n’i Heburoni; no mu tundi turere twose Dawidi n’abari kumwe na we bari baraciyemwo.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Sawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Maze Abafilisitiya bagwanya Abisirayeli; Abisirayeli barata barahunga, kandi benshi muri bo bicirwa ku musozi Gilibowa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Abafilisitiya babirukako basugereza Sawuli n’abahungu biwe, bica abahungu biwe Yonatani, Abinadabu na Maluki-Shuwa. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Maze Sawuli urugamba rumumerera nabi cane, abanyamiheto baramurasa, arakomereka bikomeye.<verse eid="1SA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Sawuli abwira uwari amutwaje ibigwanisho ati: “Sokora inkota yawe unsogote, kugira ngo izo ntakebwa ntizimfate ngo zinsogote, zinyice nabi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 31:4">Ariko uwamutwaza ibigwanisho aranka kuko yari afise ubwoba bwinshi. Nuko Sawuli afata inkota yiwe ayisukako. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Umwe yamutwaza ibigwanisho abonye ko Sawuli apfuye, na we nyene yisuka ku nkota yiwe bagwa hamwe. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Nuko Sawuli n’abahungu biwe batatu n’uwamutwaza ibigwanisho hamwe n’abantu biwe bapfira hamwe bose kuri uwo musi nyene.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Abisirayeli bari mu kiyaya n’abari hakurya ya Yorodani babonye ko ingabo z’Abisirayeli zihunze kandi ko Sawuli n’abahungu biwe bapfuye, baca bata ibisagara vyabo barahunga. Maze Abafilisitiya baraza babibamwo.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Bukeye, Abafilisitiya baja aho urugamba rwabereye kwambura abapfuye ibigwanisho n’ibintu vyabo vy’agaciro, basanga Sawuli n’abahungu biwe batatu baguye ku musozi Gilibowa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Bamuca umutwe, bamwambura n’ibigwanisho vyiwe, baca barungika intumwa mu gihugu cose c’Abafilisitiya ngo bakwize iyo nkuru mu ngoro z’ibigirwamana vyabo no mu bantu. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Baca bashira ibigwanisho vyiwe mu ngoro y’imanakazi Ashitaroti, babohera umuvyimba wiwe ku ruhome rw’i Beti-Shani.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Maze abantu b’i Yabeshi Gileyadi bumvise ivyo Abafilisitiya bakoreye Sawuli, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />abagabo bose b’abahizi bagenda ijoro ryose baja i Beti-Shani. Bafata imivyimba ya Sawuli n’abahungu biwe bayikura ku ruhome rw’i Beti-Shani, bayijana i Yabeshi barayiturira. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Maze bafata amagufa yabo bayahamba musi y’igiti c’umutamarisi c’i Yabeshi, baca barisonzesha kumara imisi indwi.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>